<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PRO" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Nhelo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nhelo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nhelo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nhel</para>
  <para style="mt">Nhelo</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Nhelo ndo kukungajizwa kwa nhelo za luhala. Walingwandika wenji nawandika chitabu achi, ila mndewa Solomoni, mwana wa Daudi, kangulonjigwa kota ndo yandiche nhelo nyinji kusinda wanji. Mndewa Solomoni nakazeleka kwa luhala lwake, chitabu cha 1 Wandewa 4:32 changumsimila kota Solomoni nakandika nhelo elufu zidatu. Lelo, nhelo nyinji nazandichigwa kuli mhela wa ukomu wa mndewa Solomoni, yawele nakawalongoza wanhu wa isi ya Isilaeli kuli kaline ya kumi, Yesu loyawele yang'hali kupondigwa. Honhu ha chitabu achi hasigale, hanji nahandichigwa na kuwichigwa hamwe, mhela uwele mndewa Hesekiya yang'hali kulongoza. Ayo Hesekiya nakawalongoza wanhu wa isi ya Yuda kwaluchila mwaka 715 mbaka mwaka 686, Yesu loyawele yang'hali kupondigwa (Nhelo 25:1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhelo ndo ndaze wanhu vyowalingulonga kwa luhala na kukomya, ila ndo vilivinji na kuwala kulagana na uloli. Nhelo 22:6 yangulonga kota wana waleligwe goya woiwinza nzila ya kutanganika mbaka howowa wasekulu. Ila nhelo ayi hailingulagana kota chila mwana kowa yatanganiche kuli kikala kwa heye kweng'ha. Hanga aku ndo kukomya, ila haiwele kuli chila mhela. Chitabu chicho cha Nhelo changusimila kuwala kunuwila kwa nhelo kuli sula ya 1:2-6. Kunuwila kwake ndo kuwatanza wana walihela uwanzi leka watang'hule luhala na kuuzela ulonzi unojile na kuwadita wala wawele na luhala wawe na luhala lukami.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Kwaluchila sula ya 1 mbaka ya 22:16 ndo nhelo za Solomoni.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 22:17 mbaka ya 24 ndo vilundo vili vya nhelo za kukungajizwa kwa ndaze wanhu vyowalingulonga kwa luhala.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 25 mbaka ya 29 ndo nhelo ziyage za Solomoni, ziwele nazikungajizwa na vitumagwa wa mndewa Hesekiya.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Sula ya 30 ndo ulonzi wa Aguli.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Sula ya 31:1-9 ina ulonzi wa Lemweli.</para>
  <para style="io">6. Kuli kuduma, sula ya 31:10-31 yangumsimila mdala yawele na madito ganojile ng'hatu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PRO 1"/>
  <para style="s">Vyoilinguganigwa kuli luhala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 1:1"/>Azi ndo nhelo za Solomoni, mndewa wa Isilaeli, mwana wa Daudi. <verse eid="PRO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 1:2"/>Nhelo azi zanguwapa wanhu luhala na kuhulichiza na kuwadita waweze kutang'hula ulonzi uwele na mana ivisigwe. <verse eid="PRO 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 1:3"/>Zanguwalangusa ndaze vyowalinguganigwa kikala kwa luhala na ndaze vyowalinguganigwa kudita mbuli kwa kutanganika na kwa hachi ne kuwa na uganililo. <verse eid="PRO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 1:4"/>Zanguwapaga wapoka kuvizela na wasongolo uwanzi wa kuhagula goya. <verse eid="PRO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 1:5"/>Yawele na nyhala yazihuliche na konjeza luhala lwa heye na yawe na ulonzi ulingumlongoza. <verse eid="PRO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 1:6"/>Munhu yauzele goya ulonzi na nhelo na ulonzi wa wala wawele na nyhala na vitendawili vya hewo.<verse eid="PRO 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 1:7"/>Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi ndo msisi wa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:7">ila wapoka wangubeza luhala na malanguso.<verse eid="PRO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi ulinguwala wana</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 1:8"/>Mwana wa heni, uhulichize malajizo kulawa kwa mhaza wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:8">uleche kugabeza malanguso ga mayako,<verse eid="PRO 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 1:9"/>ago gowa chipembelo kumutwi kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:9">na ugasi kuli singo ya hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 1:10"/>Mwana wa heni, wawele na gehile howokuhada, uleche kukunda.<verse eid="PRO 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 1:11"/>Wone wolonga, “Tuche tukamibate munhu na kumkopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:11">kwa usangalalo wa hetwe, uye leka tuwatowe walihela nongwa,<verse eid="PRO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 1:12"/>kota kuli isi ya wabagame, tuwambuze wameligwe kuno wawele wakomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:12">wowa kota wala walingudulika kuli isimo.<verse eid="PRO 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 1:13"/>Tohola vinhu vyeng'ha vya sendi nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:13">ng'handa za hetwe zeng'ha tozimemeza vinhu vyotuholile.<verse eid="PRO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 1:14"/>Uye tihanze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:14">vyeng'ha vyotupata tochigawila.”<verse eid="PRO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 1:15"/>Mwana wa heni uleche kihanza nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:15">ulemeze mgulu wa hegwe uleche kulutasa nawo,<verse eid="PRO 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 1:16"/>kwa vila magulu ga hewo gangubilimilaga kudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:16">kudita himahima kwa hewo kweng'ha ndo kubohola danda.<verse eid="PRO 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 1:17"/>Idiwa liwichigwe kuno chideje chilola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:17">lyanguwichigwa hihi hela,<verse eid="PRO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 1:18"/>ila wangupelembaga na kikopola hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:18">wanguwikaga idiwa lya kigwiliza hewo wawo.<verse eid="PRO 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 1:19"/>Ndo vyoziwele nzila za wala walingikala kwa maya ga lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:19">nhumbula za hewo zangudumyaga ukomu wa hewo wawo.<verse eid="PRO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala lwanguchema</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 1:20"/>Luhala lwanguchemaga kwa lizi mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:20">lwangulonga kwa lizi lyake kuli honhu ha kuguzila vinhu,<verse eid="PRO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 1:21"/>hawele na iyowe likulu lwangulandulaga lizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:21">kuli lwizi lwa muji lwangulongaga,<verse eid="PRO 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 1:22"/>“Hemwe wapoka! Mogana kuwa wapoka mbaka nili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:22">Mbaka hanili walingubeza wosangalala kwa chiwalo cha kubeza kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:22">na wasowile nyhala kuuzudila uwanzi?<verse eid="PRO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 1:23"/>Mhulichize makanyo ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:23">ndowajidila majesa ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:23">ndowazelesa ulonzi wa heni.<verse eid="PRO 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 1:24"/>Kwa vila nandiwachema, ila namlema kuhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:24">nandiwalajila moko kwa kuwalalika leka muye, namlema,<verse eid="PRO 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 1:25"/>kwa vila kahi namgabeza majesa ga heni geng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:25">hamgakundile makanyo ga heni,<verse eid="PRO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 1:26"/>nani ndosechelela magazo ga hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:26">Ndowabeza kwa ulonzi ung'hang'hale vyomuwa kuli kukabuswa,<verse eid="PRO 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 1:27"/>na lunhwinhwi holuwafika kota nhigu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:27">ndowabeza kahi kubagama kwa hemwe vyokuwavaba kota chivuluvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:27">mhela wa kugaya na usungu houwafika.<verse eid="PRO 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 1:28"/>Ahyo homnyhema ila sikwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:28">momhala kwa kikangaza ila hamuweza kumbona.<verse eid="PRO 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 1:29"/>Kwa vila namuuzudila uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:29">hamhagule kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,<verse eid="PRO 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 1:30"/>hamkundile kulongozwa na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:30">nambeza makanyo ga heni geng'ha,<verse eid="PRO 1:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 1:31"/>lelo, molya mafuza ga madito ga hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:31">mogutizwa mbuli zihile za mwemwe baho.<verse eid="PRO 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 1:32"/>Kwa vila wapoka wangikopola kwa kubelenhuka kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:32">wasowile nyhala wangikopolaga kwa ugata wa hewo,<verse eid="PRO 1:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 1:33"/>ila chila yalingunyhulichiza kochikala kwa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:33">kosindamala ne kudumba magazo.”<verse eid="PRO 1:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PRO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Chonolo cha luhala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 2:1"/>Mwana wa heni, ukunde ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:1">na kukumbuchila malajizo ga heni.<verse eid="PRO 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 2:2"/>Uliwiche goya ikutu lya hegwe kuhulichiza luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:2">na kuidita nhumbula ya hegwe iwe na kuvizela.<verse eid="PRO 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 2:3"/>Ena, kolanda upegwe luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:3">kodedeza upegwe kuvizela.<verse eid="PRO 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 2:4"/>Kopala luhala kota sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:4">ama kota ng'hano ivisigwe.<verse eid="PRO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 2:5"/>Kwa kudita ahyo, kovizela kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi ndo choni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:5">na kopata mana ya kumzela Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 2:6"/>Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwapaga wanhu luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:6">kumlomo kwa heye kwangulawaga uwanzi na kuvizela.<verse eid="PRO 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 2:7"/>Kanguwawichilaga walingumhulichiza ng'hano ya luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:7">heye ndo ngawo kwa wanhu walingikala kwa kugoloka.<verse eid="PRO 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 2:8"/>Kangwamilaga madito ga wanhu walingudita hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:8">na kuzilolela goya nzila za walingukundigwa wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 2:9"/>Aho ndo kolizela lyakohi litanganiche na lya hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:9">kovizela ndaze vyouweza kuleka uganililo na kuwinza chila nzila inojile.<verse eid="PRO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 2:10"/>Kwa vila luhala lwokwinjila mgati mwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:10">na uwanzi woinojeza nhumbula ya hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 2:11"/>Nhaguso zinojile zokwamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:11">kuvizela kokulolela goya,<verse eid="PRO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 2:12"/>vyokulohola kulawa kuli nzila yihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:12">na wanhu wawele na ulonzi wihile,<verse eid="PRO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 2:13"/>walinguleka nzila zigoloche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:13">leka kuziwinza nzila za jiza.<verse eid="PRO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 2:14"/>Wala walingusangalala kudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:14">na kunojezwa kwa kwajilila,<verse eid="PRO 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 2:15"/>wawele madito ga hewo nagajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:15">na azo nzila za hewo zilinguhada.<verse eid="PRO 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 2:16"/>Luhala lokudita uwe kutali na mdala mng'hondwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:16">kulawa kwa mdala mng'hondwa na ulonzi wa heye wa uhadi,<verse eid="PRO 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 2:17"/>mdala yalingumleka mlume wa heye wa kuli usongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:17">na kulisemwa ilagano lya Nguluwi wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 2:18"/>Ng'handa ya heye yanguluta kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:18">na nzila za heye kuli kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 2:19"/>Yoneche yalingumlutila, ndikomya halinguhiluka hebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:19">ne kuhiluchila kahi kuli nzila ya ukomu.<verse eid="PRO 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 2:20"/>Ahyo, hegwe kowinza kiwhana kwa wanhu wanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:20">na kibatilila nzila za watanganiche.<verse eid="PRO 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 2:21"/>Kwa vila wagoloche nhumbula wochikala kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:21">na walihela nongwa wosigala mgati mwake.<verse eid="PRO 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 2:22"/>Ila wehile wokusigwa kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:22">na wawele na nhumbula zihile wolavigwa amo.<verse eid="PRO 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PRO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi kwa wana</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 3:1"/>Mwana wa heni, uleche kusemwa malanguso ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:1">kwa nhumbula ya hegwe wibatilile mizilo ja heni.<verse eid="PRO 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 3:2"/>Kwa vila vyokupa winji wa mazuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:2">na kikala lukami na mbuli za hegwe zolutilila goya.<verse eid="PRO 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 3:3"/>Igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa vileche kuwa kutali na hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:3">Uvibate mmoko ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:3">na uvyandiche mnhumbula ya hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 3:4"/>Ahyo kowa na uganililo na kutogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:4">hali Nguluwi na hali wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 3:5"/>Witumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa nhumbula ya hegwe yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:5">uleche kitumbila nyhala za gwegwe baho.<verse eid="PRO 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 3:6"/>Umkumbuchile Nguluwi kuli chila choulingudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:6">heye kozigolola nzila za hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 3:7"/>Uleche kiwona gwegwe baho kota kuna luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:7">umdumbe Mkulu Nguluwi na kiwika kutali na wihe.<verse eid="PRO 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 3:8"/>Avyo vyowa mikwandi mlukuli lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:8">na chihewezo mli mizeje ja hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 3:9"/>Umhulichize Mkulu Nguluwi kwa lufufu lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:9">na kwa kufunya kwa chilyo cha hegwe cheng'ha cha mwaluko.<verse eid="PRO 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 3:10"/>Ahyo ng'hano za hegwe zomema nyhule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:10">na mibiga ja hegwe jomema divai inyale.<verse eid="PRO 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 3:11"/>Mwana wa heni, uleche kubeza kuzapigwa na Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:11">na uleche kuzudila kwa makanyo ga heye,<verse eid="PRO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 3:12"/>kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi kangumkanyaga yula yalingumgana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:12">kota mhaza vyoyalingumkanya mwanage yalingumgana.<verse eid="PRO 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nakatambichizwa munhu yawele na luhala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 3:13"/>Nakatambichizwa munhu yula yalingulufichila luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:13">yalingupata kuvizela.<verse eid="PRO 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 3:14"/>Luhala ndo chinhu chinojile kusinda sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:14">chinoga ng'hatu kusinda zahabu.<verse eid="PRO 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 3:15"/>Luhala ndo lunoga ng'hatu kusinda johali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:15">kuduhu choulingugana choweza kiwhana nayo.<verse eid="PRO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 3:16"/>Kwa moko wa heye wa kudilo luhala lolavya kikala lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:16">kwa moko wa heye wa kumoso lolavya lufufu na lutogo.<verse eid="PRO 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 3:17"/>Nzila za luhala ndo za kunojeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:17">zeng'ha zanguluta kuli kikala goya.<verse eid="PRO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 3:18"/>Luhala ndo igodi lya ukomu kwa weng'ha walingulipata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:18">wangutambichizwa weng'ha walingikala habehi na alyo.<verse eid="PRO 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 3:19"/>Kwa luhala Mkulu Nguluwi nakawika msisi wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:19">kwa nyhala nakawimiza nzinzili ulanga.<verse eid="PRO 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 3:20"/>Kwa uwanzi wa heye nakambuza nzanda kuchililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:20">na ng'hungugu nazilagaza nungwi.<verse eid="PRO 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 3:21"/>Mwana wa heni, wibatilile luhala na kwamula goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:21">uleche kuvileka vyuche kumeho kwa hegwe,<verse eid="PRO 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 3:22"/>vyowa ukomu kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:22">na inoligo linojile msingo ya hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 3:23"/>Aho, koweza kuluta kwa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:23">mgulu wa hegwe hauchikwang'hwala.<verse eid="PRO 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 3:24"/>Wone uwase haudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:24">houwasa kowa na usinjizi unonile.<verse eid="PRO 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 3:25"/>Uleche kudumba kwa chiwalo cha kukabuswa kwa kutinhusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:25">ne kutowigwa hamwe na wehile,<verse eid="PRO 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 3:26"/>kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yowika utumbilo kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:26">kokwamila leka mgulu wa hegwe uleche kugwilizwa.<verse eid="PRO 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 3:27"/>Louwa na ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:27">uleche kulema kumha yalingugana utanzi.<verse eid="PRO 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 3:28"/>Uleche kumlonjela munhu yomlingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:28">“Uye hamba, ndokupa mitondo,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:28">kuno hegwe kuna ludali lwa kumha choyalingugana, lehano.<verse eid="PRO 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 3:29"/>Uleche kijesa kudita gehile kwa munhu yomlingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:29">yalingikala na hegwe ne lunhwinhwi.<verse eid="PRO 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 3:30"/>Uleche kilewa na munhu ne chiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:30">wone hakuditile chinhu choneche chila chihile.<verse eid="PRO 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 3:31"/>Uleche kumonela fihi munhu yawele na nhumbula yihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:31">ne kwiga madito ga heye,<verse eid="PRO 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 3:32"/>kwa vila wajilile ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:32">ila heye kanguwaditaga goloko wa heye, wala wawele wagoloche nhumbula.<verse eid="PRO 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 3:33"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguzipanjilaga ng'handa za wanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:33">ila kanguhatambichizaga haluga ha watanganiche.<verse eid="PRO 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 3:34"/>Heye kanguwabezaga walingubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:34">ila kanguwapaga uganililo walingunyenyetela.<verse eid="PRO 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 3:35"/>Wawele na luhala wobeta lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:35">ila wasowile nyhala wopegwa soni.<verse eid="PRO 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PRO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga luhala kulawa kwa mhaza</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 4:1"/>Wana wa heni, mhulichize malanguso ga mhaza wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:1">mhulichize goya leka muwe na nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 4:2"/>Ndanguwapa malajizo ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:2">ahyo mleche kulema malanguso ga heni.<verse eid="PRO 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 4:3"/>Heni kahi nandali mwana yawele na mhaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:3">nandali chali na mwana wa udewele wa mayangu.<verse eid="PRO 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 4:4"/>Mhaza wa heni nakandangusa chinhu achi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:4">“Wibatilile kwa nhumbula yeng'ha ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:4">na mizilo ja heni, nagwe kochikala.<verse eid="PRO 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 4:5"/>Wiholele luhala, wiholele kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:5">uleche kuusemwa ne kuugaluka ulonzi wa heni.<verse eid="PRO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 4:6"/>Uleche kumleka luhala, naye kokulolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:6">umgane, naye kokwamila.<verse eid="PRO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 4:7"/>Luhala ndo lunoga kusinda vinhu vyeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:7">lelo, wiholele luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:7">ulavye vyeng'ha vyouwelenavyo, wiholele nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 4:8"/>Umone luhala kota ka chinhu chitanganiche ng'hatu, naye kokulolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:8">wone umbatilile kokupa lutogo.<verse eid="PRO 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 4:9"/>Kokuvaliza chipembelo chinojile kumutwi kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:9">kokupa itaji linojile.”<verse eid="PRO 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 4:10"/>Mwana wa heni, uhuliche na kuubochela ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:10">leka uwe na miyaka minji ja kikala.<verse eid="PRO 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 4:11"/>Ndangukulangusaga nzila ya luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:11">ndangukulongozaga kuli nzila igoloche.<verse eid="PRO 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 4:12"/>Houjenda magulu ga hegwe hagolemezwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:12">houbilima hauchikwang'hwala.<verse eid="PRO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 4:13"/>Wibatilile malanguso ga luhala na uleche kumleka yasulupuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:13">umbatilile goya kwa vila heye ndo ukomu wa hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 4:14"/>Uleche kiyinjiza kuli nzila ya wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:14">uleche kuwinza madito ga hewo.<verse eid="PRO 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 4:15"/>Wiwiche kutali na nzila ayo ne kuihejelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:15">wiyuse na ayo, wuche.<verse eid="PRO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 4:16"/>Wehile hambe wawase wone hawaditile wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:16">hawawaga na usinjizi ne kumditila vibi munhu,<verse eid="PRO 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 4:17"/>kwa vila wihe ndo chilyo cha hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:17">nhumbula zihile ndo divai ya hewo.<verse eid="PRO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 4:18"/>Nzila ya wanhu watanganiche ndo kota lumuli lwa lufuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:18">lulingupulika lukami mbaka nemisi,<verse eid="PRO 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 4:19"/>ila nzila ya wehile ndo kota jiza totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:19">hawavizelele chilinguwadita wekwang'wale.<verse eid="PRO 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 4:20"/>Mwana wa heni, uhulichize goya ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:20">uwiche goya ikutu kuli nhelo za heni.<verse eid="PRO 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 4:21"/>Uleche kuvileka vyajilile hali meho ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:21">uviwiche goya mgati mwa nhumbula ya hegwe,<verse eid="PRO 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 4:22"/>kwa vila avyo ndo ukomu kwa munhu yalinguvipata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:22">ndo mikwandi kwa lukuli lwa heye lweng'ha.<verse eid="PRO 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 4:23"/>Mzidi wa ago geng'ha, wamile goya nhumbula ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:23">kwa vila ayo ndo mwaluko wa ukomu.<verse eid="PRO 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 4:24"/>Wiwiche kutali na ulonzi wa udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:24">na mlomo wa hegwe uleche kulonga mbuli za uhadi.<verse eid="PRO 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 4:25"/>Meho ga hegwe galole kulutila kumwando,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:25">uwe ulola kumwando yeka.<verse eid="PRO 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 4:26"/>Wijese nzila youihola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:26">goulingudita geng'ha gowa genele.<verse eid="PRO 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 4:27"/>Uleche kuhinduka kudilo ne kumoso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:27">uwiche mgulu wa hegwe kutali na wihe.<verse eid="PRO 4:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PRO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Makanyo galinguwala ung'hondwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 5:1"/>Msongolo wa heni, uhuliche luhala lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:1">uwiche goya ikutu uhulichize malanguso ga heni,<verse eid="PRO 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 5:2"/>leka wamule goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:2">na mlomo wa hegwe ubatilile uwanzi.<verse eid="PRO 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 5:3"/>Mlomo wa mdala mng'hondwa ndo unona kota hanombwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:3">ulonzi wa heye ndo ulobwanika kusinda mafuta,<verse eid="PRO 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 5:4"/>ila kuli kuduma ndo wa usungu kota nhungwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:4">wangutema kota ipanga linoleche banzi zeng'ha.<verse eid="PRO 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 5:5"/>Nzayo za heye zangulutila hanyi kuli kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:5">kangujenda kuli nzila ya kuluta kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="PRO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 5:6"/>Halingijesa kuwala nzila ya ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:6">nzila za heye ndo za kulubaluba, havizelele.<verse eid="PRO 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 5:7"/>Lelo hemwe wasongolo wa heni, mnyhulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:7">mleche kusemwa ulonzi wa mlomo wa heni.<verse eid="PRO 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 5:8"/>Mziwiche nzila za hemwe kutali na mdala kota ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:8">mleche kuhejelela kuli lwizi lwa ng'handa ya heye.<verse eid="PRO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 5:9"/>Mleche kujeza kuwapa wanji lutogo lwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:9">na miyaka ja hemwe kwa yawele na nhumbula yihile,<verse eid="PRO 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 5:10"/>wajenzi waleche kigutiza kwa lufufu lwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:10">leka vinhu vyeng'ha vyompatile kwa kukola mijito, vileche kuluta kwa wajenzi.<verse eid="PRO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 5:11"/>Kuduma kwa ukomu wa hemwe molombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:11">mhela ng'huli za hemwe hozidumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 5:12"/>Aho molonga, “Ndaze vyondikuzudile kuzapigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:12">na kubeza makanyo mnhumbula mwa heni.<verse eid="PRO 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 5:13"/>Sihulichize lizi lya walangusa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:13">ne kuwawichila goya ikutu wandanguse.<verse eid="PRO 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 5:14"/>Lelo nda habehi kudumigwa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:14">hali wanhu wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="PRO 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 5:15"/>Mchewako ndo kota izimbo lya mazi ganojile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:15">Unwe mazi ga izimbo lya gwegwe baho.<verse eid="PRO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 5:16"/>Lekachoni nzasa za hegwe ziwichigwe kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:16">na nzanda za mazi mnzila?<verse eid="PRO 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 5:17"/>Azo ndo za gwegwe baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:17">uleche kuwahanza wanhu wanji.<verse eid="PRO 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 5:18"/>Nzasa ya hegwe itambichizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:18">usangalale kwa chiwalo cha mchewako youmuholile louwele msongolo.<verse eid="PRO 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 5:19"/>Ndo kanoga kota ibala, kangujenda goya kota chifuno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:19">Mhambaga ya heye ikugalile kusangalala chila mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:19">ugale mazuwa gose na matombo ga heye.<verse eid="PRO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 5:20"/>Msongolo wa heni, lekachoni nakubatigwa ng'hatu na mdala mng'hondwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:20">Lekachoni nakumkumbatila mmhambaga mdala wa mlume yunji?<verse eid="PRO 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 5:21"/>Ukumbuchile nzila za munhu za hazelu hali Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:21">heye kangona chila chinhu choyalingudita munhu.<verse eid="PRO 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 5:22"/>Mwihe kangugwilizwaga kwa wihe wa heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:22">kangubatigwa kwa ng'weso za gehile ga heye yuye.<verse eid="PRO 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 5:23"/>Kangubagama kwa kuleka kuhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:23">kangudumigwa kwa chiwalo cha upoka wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 5:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PRO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Makanyo ganji</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 6:1"/>Msongolo wa heni, wone nakulagana kota koweza kiwika lehani kwa chiwalo cha youlingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:1">wone nakulagana kwa chiwalo cha yunji,<verse eid="PRO 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 6:2"/>wone nakidinya kwa ulonzi wa gwegwe baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:2">nakigwiliza kwa kulagana kwa hegwe,<verse eid="PRO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 6:3"/>uvizele kota hegwe, kwa kuli ludali lwa munhu yula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:3">Ila msongolo wa heni, wone kwangugana kilohola, lelo udite ahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:3">umlutile munhu ayo mala imwe, umdedeze yakupe kilejeha kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 6:4"/>Wikangaze uleche kuleka meho ga hegwe gawe na usinjizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:4">uleche kukunda gasinzile.<verse eid="PRO 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 6:5"/>Wilohole kwa kilavya kuli idiwa alyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:5">kota chifuno ama chideje chilingisukula kwa yalingupelemba.<verse eid="PRO 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 6:6"/>Hegwe mgata! Ulute ukalilole isisina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:6">wijese vyolilinguganigwa kikala leka uwe na luhala.<verse eid="PRO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 6:7"/>Isisina lyahela chilongozi ne mkulu ne yalingulongoza,<verse eid="PRO 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 6:8"/>ila lyangiwichila chilyo mhela wa chipalangule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:8">lyangukungajizaga na kuwika kuli ng'hano, mhela wa kubeta.<verse eid="PRO 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 6:9"/>Hegwe mgata, kowasa aho mbaka nili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:9">Kolilimka nili kuli usinjizi wa hegwe?<verse eid="PRO 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 6:10"/>Kwangilonjela, “Uwase hado hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:10">usinzile hado.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:10">Uswinize moko ga hegwe wesele hado.”<verse eid="PRO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 6:11"/>Mhela awo uzunwa wokuvaba kota yalinguboka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:11">kupunguchilwa kokuwinza kota muhizi.<verse eid="PRO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 6:12"/>Mwihe ama mjuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:12">kangulubaluba yolonga ulonzi wihile,<verse eid="PRO 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 6:13"/>kuno yokonyeza kuwajiliza wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:13">kangupananga kwa uzayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:13">na kuwalajila wanhu kwa vidole.<verse eid="PRO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 6:14"/>Yawele yamemile uhadi mnhumbula kangulonga wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:14">kangwambuzaga kilewa chila honhu.<verse eid="PRO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 6:15"/>Kwa chiwalo acho kubagama komfika himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:15">baho du kogazika vibi ne kuwa na kitumbila.<verse eid="PRO 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 6:16"/>Hana vinhu sita, viwele Mkulu Nguluwi kanguvizudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:16">ena, vinhu saba viwele ndo izudizo kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 6:17"/>Meho ga ujuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:17">umyango wa uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:17">moko galingukopola walihela nongwa,<verse eid="PRO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 6:18"/>nhumbula ilingijesa mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:18">magulu galingubilimila kudita wihe,<verse eid="PRO 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 6:19"/>mlolezi yalingulavya udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:19">na munhu yalingwambuza wihe hali wenyelukolo.<verse eid="PRO 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo galinguwala ung'hondwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 6:20"/>Msongolo wa heni, wibatilile malajizo ga mhaza wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:20">uleche kusemwa malanguso ga mayako.<verse eid="PRO 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 6:21"/>Ugawiche mnhumbula mwa hegwe mhela weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:21">ugabatilile mmoko mwa hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 6:22"/>Gokulongoza kuli nzila ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:22">gokwamila mhela houwasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:22">gokulangusa ganojile mhela wa nemisi.<verse eid="PRO 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 6:23"/>Kwa vila mzilo awo ndo chenje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:23">na ilajizo alyo ndo lumuli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:23">Makanyo ago na kuhulichiza gokuwika kuli nzila ya ukomu.<verse eid="PRO 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 6:24"/>Gokwamila leka uwe kutali na mdala yehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:24">gokuwika kutali na ulonzi wa uhadi wa mdala mng'hondwa.<verse eid="PRO 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 6:25"/>Uleche kumgana mdala ayo kwa kunoga kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:25">uleche kukunda kugwilizwa na meho ga heye.<verse eid="PRO 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 6:26"/>Kuwasa na mdala mng'hondwa komdita mlume yawe mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:26">ila kuwasa na mche wa munhu yunji kowajiliza ukomu weng'ha.<verse eid="PRO 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 6:27"/>Ndaze, koweza kuwika chiluli mmhambaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:27">na nguwo za hegwe zileche kulakala?<verse eid="PRO 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 6:28"/>Ndaze, koweza kubiga makala ga chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:28">na uzayo wa hegwe uleche kulakala?<verse eid="PRO 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 6:29"/>Ndo vyoyawele mlume yalinguwasa na mche wa myage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:29">yoneche yalingumdoliza mdala ayo holeka kugazigwa.<verse eid="PRO 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 6:30"/>Wanhu hawalingumbeza ng'hatu munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:30">wone yohiza kwa chiwalo cha nzala,<verse eid="PRO 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 6:31"/>ila wone yebatigwe yomlapa yalipe mala saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:31">kolavya kahi lufufu lweng'ha lwoyawele nalo.<verse eid="PRO 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 6:32"/>Mlume yalinguwasa na mche wa munhu yunji kahela nyhala ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:32">ayo kangidumya heye yuye.<verse eid="PRO 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 6:33"/>Kopata vilonda na kubezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:33">soni hoyopata haikuka kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 6:34"/>Kwa vila fihi ya mlume yomdita yawe yang'hang'hale ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:34">mhela hoyohilula chibida kahela cha kuchonela isungu.<verse eid="PRO 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 6:35"/>Hokunda kupegwa sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:35">ne kuhembulizwa na ndolendole nyinji.<verse eid="PRO 6:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PRO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mdala mng'hondwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 7:1"/>Msongolo wa heni, wibatilile ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:1">ujiwiche mizilo ja heni mgati mwako kota lufufu.<verse eid="PRO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 7:2"/>Ujiwinze mizilo ja heni nagwe kochikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:2">ugamile malanguso ga heni kota iziho lya hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 7:3"/>Ugawohe kuli vidole vya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:3">ugandiche mnhumbula mwa hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 7:4"/>Ululonjele luhala, “Hegwe ndo lumbu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:4">hegwe ndo goloko wa heni.”<verse eid="PRO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 7:5"/>Lwokwamila na mdala yehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:5">lwokuwika kutali na ulonzi unonile wa mdala mng'hondwa.<verse eid="PRO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 7:6"/>Zuwa limwe kuli itubuli lya ng'handa ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:6">nasunjilila kwa kukolela itubuli,<verse eid="PRO 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 7:7"/>nandiwona wasongolo wenji wapoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:7">na yumwe yawele yasowile nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 7:8"/>Ayo nayali yojenda kuli nzila yila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:8">habehi na nzingo koyekale mdala yumwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:8">Lelo nakawinza nzila ilinguluta haluga ha mdala yula.<verse eid="PRO 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 7:9"/>Nawali mhela wa matinazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:9">jiza na nechilo navyali vyaluche kwinjila.<verse eid="PRO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 7:10"/>Lelo, msongolo nakating'hana na mdala ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:10">yavalile kota mng'hondwa, yawele kuli usugu wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 7:11"/>Nayali mdala yalingulonga ne kupwepwa na mjuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:11">magulu ga heye hambe gasindamale haluga,<verse eid="PRO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 7:12"/>mhela umwenga ganguwa mnzila, mhela wunji kuli soko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:12">kuli chila nzingo ya nzila kanguwa baho yopelemba.<verse eid="PRO 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 7:13"/>Nakamkumbatila msongolo ayo na kumnonela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:13">ne soni, nakamlonjela,<verse eid="PRO 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 7:14"/>“Ndanajo miwunde ja nhambiko kaye kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:14">lehano nanyeneza chilaho cha heni.<verse eid="PRO 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 7:15"/>Ndo mina nandawa leka ndikubochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:15">nandikupala ng'hatu, lelo nandikupata.<verse eid="PRO 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 7:16"/>Nambika goya chinhanda cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:16">kwa igolole lya lanji za kitani kulawa Misili.<verse eid="PRO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 7:17"/>Nambika unhunyhililo wa manemane na udi na mdalasini.<verse eid="PRO 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 7:18"/>Uye tuwase hamwe mbaka mitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:18">uye tikofye kwa kigana.<verse eid="PRO 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 7:19"/>Mlume wa heni ka haduhuli kaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:19">nakaluta kuli majendo ga kutali.<verse eid="PRO 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 7:20"/>Nakahola sendi nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:20">hohiluka kaye himahima.”<verse eid="PRO 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 7:21"/>Nakamhada kwa ulonzi wa kuhembuliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:21">msongolo nakakunda kwa ulonzi wa heye unonile.<verse eid="PRO 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 7:22"/>Baho du, msongolo nakamuwinza mdala ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:22">kota isenga lilinguluta kuli honhu ha kudumulila singo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:22">kota chifuno chilingunomochela midiwa.<verse eid="PRO 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 7:23"/>Nayali havizelele kota kowajiliza ukomu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:23">mbaka hoyonile nakawa kota nakahomigwa msale mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:23">nakawa kota chideje chigwilile kuli utandawala.<verse eid="PRO 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 7:24"/>Lelo wasongolo wa heni, mnyhulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:24">muuwichile goya makutu ulonzi wa heni.<verse eid="PRO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 7:25"/>Mleche kukunda kulongozwa na mdala kota ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:25">ne kukola kuli nzila za heye.<verse eid="PRO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 7:26"/>Kwa vila nakawagwisa walume wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:26">ndo wenji lukami awo yawadumule singo.<verse eid="PRO 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 7:27"/>Ng'handa ya heye ndo nzila ya kuluta kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:27">ndo honhu ha kudulichila kuli kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 7:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PRO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Nyhemo ya luhala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 8:1"/>Mhulichize! Luhala kanguchema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:1">Luhala kangukwiniza lizi lya heye.<verse eid="PRO 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 8:2"/>Mchanya henuche habehi na nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:2">kuli nzila mhanda ndo hoyewichile.<verse eid="PRO 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 8:3"/>Habehi na lwizi lwa kwinjilila mujini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:3">honhu howalingwinjila wanhu, kanguchema kwa lizi,<verse eid="PRO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 8:4"/>“Hemwe wanhu weng'ha, ndanguwachema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:4">Nyhemo ya heni ndo kwa chiwalo cha wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 8:5"/>Hemwe wapoka, milanguse kuwa na nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:5">mhulichize goya hemwe msowile nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 8:6"/>Mhulichize kwa vila chondilonga ndo mbuli zitanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:6">kuli mlomo wa heni zangulawa mbuli za hachi.<verse eid="PRO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 8:7"/>Mlomo wa heni wolonga kukomya yeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:7">wihe ndo izudizo kumlomo kwa heni.<verse eid="PRO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 8:8"/>Mlomo wa heni wolonga ulonzi wa kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:8">haduhu ne limwe liwele nalyajilila ama lya ujuvi.<verse eid="PRO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 8:9"/>Kwa munhu yalinguweza kutang'hula, ulonzi awu wa hazelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:9">kwa yawele na uwanzi, ulonzi awu ndo wa kutanganika.<verse eid="PRO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 8:10"/>Uhagule malanguso ga heni honhu ha sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:10">na uwanzi honhu ha zahabu inojile.<verse eid="PRO 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 8:11"/>Heni luhala, noga lukami kusinda johali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:11">choneche choulinguchonela maya hachiweza kiwhana na heni.<verse eid="PRO 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 8:12"/>“Heni luhala ndangikala na uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:12">ndanawo uwanzi na nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 8:13"/>Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi ndo kuzudila wihe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:13">Ndanguuzudila ujuvi na kidaya na kikala kwihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:13">ndanguzizudila ndonga zihile.<verse eid="PRO 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 8:14"/>Ndina ludali lwa kulonga ganojile na ndina luhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:14">Ndanawo uwanzi na ndina mong'ho.<verse eid="PRO 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 8:15"/>Kwa utanzi wa heni, wandewa wangulongozaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:15">vilongozi wangwamulaga gawele ga hachi.<verse eid="PRO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 8:16"/>Kwa utanzi wa heni, vilongozi wangulongozaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:16">wakulu na walingulongoza kwa hachi.<verse eid="PRO 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 8:17"/>Ndanguwagana wala walingungana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:17">walingumhala ng'hatu wangumbona.<verse eid="PRO 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 8:18"/>Lufufu na lutogo vya kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:18">vinhu vya sendi nyinji vya kikala mazuwa gose na kutanganika.<verse eid="PRO 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 8:19"/>Mafuza ga heni ndo ganoga kusinda zahabu inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:19">mbena za heni za mzidi ndo kusinda sendi inojile.<verse eid="PRO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 8:20"/>Ndangujenda kuli nzila ya kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:20">ndanguwinza nzila za hachi.<verse eid="PRO 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 8:21"/>Ndanguwapaga lufufu walingungana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:21">ndanguzimemezaga ng'hatu ng'hano zawo.”<verse eid="PRO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 8:22"/>Luhala nalulutilila kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:22">“Mkulu Nguluwi nakandita kuli mwaluko wa mijito ja heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:22">mhela wa katali kung'hali kuwa na chinhu choneche.<verse eid="PRO 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 8:23"/>Nanditigwa mwaluko wa mihela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:23">nandali kuko lokung'hali kwaluka isi.<verse eid="PRO 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 8:24"/>Namhondigwa kung'hali kuwa na bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:24">kung'hali kuwa na nzasa zilingulavya mazi.<verse eid="PRO 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 8:25"/>Namhondigwa kung'hali vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:25">na vigongo kwimizwa honhu hake,<verse eid="PRO 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 8:26"/>kung'hali Nguluwi hanailumba isi na migunda jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:26">ne vihande vya mwaluko vya nhimbwisi ya isi.<verse eid="PRO 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 8:27"/>Nandali aho mhela hoyauwichile ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:27">mhela woyacholile msitali wa kiting'hana kwa bahali na ulanga,<verse eid="PRO 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 8:28"/>mhela woyaziwichile nzinzili ng'hungugu kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:28">vyoyaziditile nzasa za bahali ziwe nzinzili,<verse eid="PRO 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 8:29"/>mhela woyaiwichile bahali mbaka wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:29">mazi gake galeche kuya kubena mizilo ja heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:29">mhela hoyajiwichile misisi ja isi.<verse eid="PRO 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 8:30"/>Nandali hamwe na heye kota muwanzi ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:30">nandali usangalalo kwa heye chila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:30">nasangalala hali heye mazuwa gose,<verse eid="PRO 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 8:31"/>nandiisangalalila isi na wenyeng'haye wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:31">na kunojezwa kuwa hamwe na wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 8:32"/>“Lelo wasongolo wa heni, mhulichize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:32">Fola wala walinguwinza nzila za heni.<verse eid="PRO 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 8:33"/>Mhulichize malanguso leka muwe na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:33">na mleche kugalema.<verse eid="PRO 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 8:34"/>Kotambichizwa munhu yalingunyhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:34">yalingikalisa chila zuwa hali lwizi lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:34">yalinguwa meho habehi na lwizi lwa heni.<verse eid="PRO 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 8:35"/>Yalingumhata heni kanguwa na ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:35">kana uganililo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PRO 8:36"/>Yalingulemwela kumhata heni kangilumizaga yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:36">weng'ha walingunzudila wangugana kubagama.”<verse eid="PRO 8:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PRO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Luhala na upoka</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 9:1"/>Luhala ndo kota mdala yazenjile ng'handa yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:1">ng'handa iwele na mizengo saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ng'handa iwele na mizengo saba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ulonzi awu hauwele hazelu. Ajo mizengo saba ama milingo saba hanji ndo kuwala misisi ama milingo jiwele Mkulu Nguluwi nakajizenga mhela wa kuilumba isi (ulole sula ya 8:29-30) ama ndo kuwala hisabu saba iwele yangutumika mala nyinji kuli Bibiliya kota kiwhana kwa kwenela.</char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 9:2"/>Nakajidumula singo migongolo ja mnvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:2">divai yake nakaiwika goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:2">nakachiwika goya chisaga chake.<verse eid="PRO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 9:3"/>Nakawalajiza vitumagwa wa heye wadala mujini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:3">wawacheme wanhu kulawa kuli vinhembenhembe vya vigongo,<verse eid="PRO 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 9:4"/>“Yoneche yawele mpoka yoye hano.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:4">Na yoneche yasowile nyhala kangumlonjelaga,<verse eid="PRO 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 9:5"/>“Uye ulye chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:5">na unwe divai yongongomanye.<verse eid="PRO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 9:6"/>Wileche na upoka leka wikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:6">uwinze nzila ya nyhala.”<verse eid="PRO 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 9:7"/>Yalingumlonga yalingubeza kangupataga maligo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:7">yalingumng'hanuchila mwihe kangudumilaga kwa kulumizwa.<verse eid="PRO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 9:8"/>Uleche kumkanya yalingubeza kwa vila kokuzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:8">umkanye yawele na luhala naye kokugana.<verse eid="PRO 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 9:9"/>Umlanguse yawele na luhala, ayo kolutilila kuwa na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:9">mlanguse yatanganiche, naye kolutilila kuwa na kuvizela.<verse eid="PRO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 9:10"/>Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi ndo msisi wa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:10">na kumzela yula Yelile ndo kuwa na nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 9:11"/>Kwa utanzi wa heni luhala, mazuwa ga hegwe gokonjezwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:11">kokonjezelwa miyaka minji kuli ukomu wa hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 9:12"/>Wone kuna luhala, lwokupa chonolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:12">wone ulubeze, kogazika ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 9:13"/>Upoka ndo kota mdala yalingulonga kwa lizi likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:13">ndo kahela nyhala na havizelele chinhu.<verse eid="PRO 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 9:14"/>Kangikalisaga hali lwizi lwa ng'handa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:14">kanguwikaga chigoda cha heye honhu ha kuchanya mujini,<verse eid="PRO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 9:15"/>na kuwachema wanhu walingukola mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:15">wanhu walinguluta kuli mijito ja hewo,<verse eid="PRO 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 9:16"/>“Yoneche yawele mpoka yoye hano.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:16">Yoneche yasowile nyhala kangumlonjelaga,<verse eid="PRO 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 9:17"/>“Mazi ga uhizi ndo ganona ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:17">ibumunda lilinguligwa kwa uviso ndo linona lukami.”<verse eid="PRO 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 9:18"/>Ila mpoka havizelele kota amo hana wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:18">wajenzi wa mdala ayo wa hasi kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="PRO 9:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PRO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Nhelo za Solomoni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 10:1"/>Azi ndo nhelo za Solomoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:1">Msongolo yawele na luhala ndo usangalalo kwa mhaza wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:1">ila msongolo yasowile luhala ndo masinzo kwa mayake.<verse eid="PRO 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 10:2"/>Ng'hano ilingulawa kuli nzila zihile haiwele inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:2">ila kutanganika kwangumloholaga munhu kulawa kuli kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 10:3"/>Mkulu Nguluwi halinguwalekaga watanganiche wawe na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:3">ila kangulemaga maya ga wehile.<verse eid="PRO 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 10:4"/>Ugata wangwambuza uzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:4">ila moko ga munhu ga kikangaza gangigalaga lufufu.<verse eid="PRO 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 10:5"/>Yawele na luhala kangukungajizaga mhela wa mbena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:5">kuwasa mhela wa kubeta ndo soni.<verse eid="PRO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 10:6"/>Yatanganiche kangigalilaga utambichizo heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:6">ila mlomo wa mwihe wanguvisaga wihe.<verse eid="PRO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 10:7"/>Watanganiche wokumbuchilwa kwa utambichizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:7">ila wehile wosemwigwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 10:8"/>Yawele na luhala mnhumbula kanguhulichizaga mizilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:8">ila yula mpoka yalingulosoka kodumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 10:9"/>Yalingikala kwa kugoloka kangikalaga goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:9">yalingwajiliza kikala kwa heye kozeleka.<verse eid="PRO 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 10:10"/>Yalingukonyeza kwa kunuwila kwihile kangwambuzaga magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:10">ila mpoka yalingulosoka kodumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 10:11"/>Mlomo wa yatanganiche ndo nzasa ya ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:11">ila mlomo wa mwihe wanguvisa kilewa.<verse eid="PRO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 10:12"/>Kuzudila kwangwambuzaga kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:12">ila igano lyangugubikaga gehile geng'ha.<verse eid="PRO 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 10:13"/>Kumlomo kwa munhu yawele na kuvizela kuna luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:13">ila wapoka wozapigwa ng'hobwa kumgongo.<verse eid="PRO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 10:14"/>Wawele na luhala wanguulolelaga uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:14">ila kulosoka kwa mpoka kwangigalaga kudumigwa himahima.<verse eid="PRO 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 10:15"/>Lufufu lwa yawele na lufufu ndo ngome ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:15">uzunwa wa mzunwa wangumgalilaga kudumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 10:16"/>Chonolo cha munhu yanojile ndo ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:16">ila mwihe kangudumaga kuli gehile.<verse eid="PRO 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 10:17"/>Yalingukunda kukanyigwa kangulutila kuli ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:17">ila yalingulema, kangwajilila.<verse eid="PRO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 10:18"/>Yalingumzudila yunji kwa uviso ndo mdesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:18">yalingumvilizila munhu ka mpoka.<verse eid="PRO 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 10:19"/>Kodita gehile wone kolonga lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:19">ila yawele na luhala kunguulemeza mlomo wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 10:20"/>Ulonzi wa munhu yatanganiche ndo kota sendi inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:20">majesa ga munhu mwihe hagalingutanza choneche.<verse eid="PRO 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 10:21"/>Ulonzi wa munhu yatanganiche wanguwatanza wanhu wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:21">ila wapoka wangubagama kwa vila wahela nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 10:22"/>Utambichizo wa Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ulingigala lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:22">kikangaza kwa munhu hambe konjeze choneche.<verse eid="PRO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 10:23"/>Kwa wapoka, kudita wihe ndo kota mdawalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:23">ila wawele na nyhala wangusangalalaga kwa chiwalo cha luhala.<verse eid="PRO 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 10:24"/>Choyalingudumba mwihe ndo chompata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:24">ila choyalingugana yatanganiche ndo choyopegwa.<verse eid="PRO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 10:25"/>Chivuluvumbi changukolaga na mwihe kangwajililaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:25">ila yatanganiche kanguwichigwa nzinzili mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PRO 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 10:26"/>Kota vyoiwele sichi kuli mizino ama iyosi kuli meho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:26">ndo vyoyawele mgata kwa mkulu wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 10:27"/>Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi kwangonjezaga ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:27">ila miyaka ja wehile jowa michefu.<verse eid="PRO 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 10:28"/>Kitumbila kwa yatanganiche kwangumalilaga kuli usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:28">ila kubeteza kwa mwihe kwangudumilaga hihi hela.<verse eid="PRO 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 10:29"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ngome ya wagoloche nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:29">ila walingudita gehile wodumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 10:30"/>Watanganiche hawokusigwa hebu muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:30">ila wehile hawochikala kuli isi.<verse eid="PRO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 10:31"/>Mlomo wa yatanganiche wangulavya mbuli za luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:31">ila umyango wajilile wodumuligwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 10:32"/>Milomo ja watanganiche janguvizela galingukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:32">ila ja wehile jangulongaga wihe hela.<verse eid="PRO 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PRO 11"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 11:1"/>Mizani ja uhadi ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:1">ila chipimilo cha hachi ndo usangalalo kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 11:2"/>Walingidaya wanguwa hamwe na kudeula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:2">ila kwa wanhu walingunyenyetela wana luhala.<verse eid="PRO 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 11:3"/>Kugoloka kwa wanhu wanojile kwanguwalongozaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:3">kwajilila kwa wawele na nhumbula zihile kwanguwadumyaga.<verse eid="PRO 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 11:4"/>Kuwa na lufufu hambe kutanze chinhu kuli zuwa lya kuzudila kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:4">ila kutanganika kwanguloholaga kulawa kuli kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 11:5"/>Kutanganika kwa walihela nongwa kwangugololaga nzila ya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:5">ila wehile wangugwa kwa gehile ga hewo wawo.<verse eid="PRO 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 11:6"/>Kutanganika kwa wanhu wagoloche nhumbula kwanguwaloholaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:6">ila wawele na nhumbula zihile wangugwilizwaga kwa maya ga hewo wawo.<verse eid="PRO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 11:7"/>Wone mwihe yabagame na kitumbila kwa heye nako kwangwajililaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:7">geng'ha goyajesile kupata kwa mong'ho wa heye ganguwaga hihi hela.<verse eid="PRO 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 11:8"/>Yatanganiche kanguloholigwaga kuli magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:8">na mwihe kangwinjila amo honhu ha heye.<verse eid="PRO 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 11:9"/>Yohambe yamdumbe Nguluwi kanguwadumyaga wanji kwa mlomo wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:9">ila yatanganiche kanguloholigwa kwa uwanzi wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 11:10"/>Wone watanganiche wopegwa utambichizo, muji wotowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:10">na wone wehile wodumigwa, wanhu wosangalala.<verse eid="PRO 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 11:11"/>Muji wanguwaga unojile kwa utambichizo wa watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:11">ila wangudumigwa kwa milomo ja wehile.<verse eid="PRO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 11:12"/>Yalingumbeza munhu yalingikalasa habehi na heye kahela nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:12">munhu yawele na luhala kanginyamalilaga.<verse eid="PRO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 11:13"/>Yalingukolakola yoheha kangulavyaga uviso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:13">ila yalingukundigwa kuli muhe kanguwikaga uviso.<verse eid="PRO 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 11:14"/>Hali hela ulongozi isi yangugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:14">hawele na wanhu wenji wa kulonga ganojile hanguwa na kikala goya.<verse eid="PRO 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 11:15"/>Yalingiwika lehani kwa chiwalo cha mjenzi, kokuya kung'ung'uta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:15">ila yalinguzudila kudita mbuli azo ka honhu ha kikala goya.<verse eid="PRO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 11:16"/>Mdala yawele na nhumbula ya isungu kangutogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:16">mlume yalingugana kilewa kanguwa na lufufu hela.<verse eid="PRO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 11:17"/>Munhu yawele na nhumbula inojile kanguwaga na vinhu vinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:17">ila mjuvi kangilumizaga yuye.<verse eid="PRO 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 11:18"/>Chinhu cha mzidi choyalingupata mwihe ndo cha udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:18">ila yalingunyala kutanganika kopata chonolo cha kukomya.<verse eid="PRO 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 11:19"/>Munhu yalingulutilila kuli kutanganika kochikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:19">ila yalinguhagula kudita gehile kobagama.<verse eid="PRO 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 11:20"/>Wawele na nhumbula zajilile ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:20">ila walihela nongwa ndo usangalalo wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 11:21"/>Ndangukomya, mwihe hosulupuka kuli magazo kwa madito ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:21">ila watanganiche woloholigwa.<verse eid="PRO 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 11:22"/>Mdala yanojile yalihela luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:22">ndo kota pete ya zahabu mmhenyhelo mwa igubi.<verse eid="PRO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 11:23"/>Kitumbila kwa watanganiche kwangigalaga ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:23">maya ga wehile gangumalilaga kuli kuzudila kwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 11:24"/>Yalingulavya sendi kwa isungu kangonjezelwaga lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:24">ila yohaganile kulavya kangubatigwa kuli uzunwa.<verse eid="PRO 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 11:25"/>Munhu yawele na nhumbula ya kulavya utanzi, mbuli za heye zolutilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:25">yalingumnweza myage mazi naye konwezwa.<verse eid="PRO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 11:26"/>Wanhu wangumpanjilaga yalinguvisa nyhule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:26">ila wangumganilaga utambichizo yalinguguza.<verse eid="PRO 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 11:27"/>Yalingupala kudita ganojile kangupegwa kunoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:27">ila yalingupala kudita wihe kofichigwa na wihe.<verse eid="PRO 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 11:28"/>Yalingitumbila lufufu lwa heye kogwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:28">ila yatanganiche kodedemka kota ihamba idodi.<verse eid="PRO 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 11:29"/>Yalinguibena ng'handa ya heye kopata mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:29">mpoka kowa mpogozi wa wawele na luhala.<verse eid="PRO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 11:30"/>Madito ga yatanganiche gangigalaga ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:30">naye yawele na luhala kangukwegaga nhumbula za wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 11:31"/>Wone yatanganiche kangupegwa chonolo aha muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:31">ndangukomya, mwihe ama yawele na gehile kopegwa chihile ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 11:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PRO 12"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 12:1"/>Yalingugana kuhulichiza kanguganaga uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:1">ila yohambe yagane kukanyigwa ndo yalihela nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 12:2"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangunojezwa na munhu yanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:2">ila yawele na kunuwila kwihile kangupanjilwa na Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 12:3"/>Munhu howeza kuwa nzinzili kwa kudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:3">ila haduhu chilinguweza kumusa yatanganiche.<verse eid="PRO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 12:4"/>Mdala yawele na nhumbula inojile ndo lutogo kwa mlume wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:4">ila yalingumbasa soni mlume wa heye ndo kota chilonda mmizeje ja heye.<verse eid="PRO 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 12:5"/>Majesa ga yatanganiche ndo ga hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:5">ila ulonzi wa mwihe ndo wa uhadi.<verse eid="PRO 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 12:6"/>Ulonzi wa wanhu wehile wangugana kukopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:6">ila ulonzi wa watanganiche wanguwaloholaga.<verse eid="PRO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 12:7"/>Wehile wangudumigwa na kwajilila ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:7">ila ivyazi lya wawele na hachi lyangwimaga nzinzili.<verse eid="PRO 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 12:8"/>Munhu kangutogoligwa kwa kiwhana na luhala lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:8">ila wanhu wawele na majesa gajilile wangubezigwa.<verse eid="PRO 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 12:9"/>Fola munhu wa hihi hela yalingulya kwa mijito ja heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:9">kusinda kidita kuna lufufu, kuno kwahela chilyo.<verse eid="PRO 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 12:10"/>Munhu yatanganiche kanguwaga na isungu kwa migongolo ja heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:10">ila mbaka madito ga mwihe ga isungu, ganguwa nhumbula yihile.<verse eid="PRO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 12:11"/>Yalingulima mgunda wa heye kowa na chilyo chinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:11">ila yalinguwinza mbuli za kulota kahela kuvizela.<verse eid="PRO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 12:12"/>Wehile wanguganaga kuwa na vinhu vya wehile wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:12">ila watanganiche wangwimaga nzinzili.<verse eid="PRO 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 12:13"/>Mwihe kangugwilizwaga kwa ulonzi wa heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:13">ila yatanganiche kangiwikaga kutali na magazo.<verse eid="PRO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 12:14"/>Mbuli za munhu zangulutililaga goya kwa kiwhana na ulonzi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:14">kota vyoyalingupata chila chilinguya, kulawa kuli mijito ja moko ga heye.<verse eid="PRO 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 12:15"/>Mpoka kanguyonaga nzila ya heye kota ya goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:15">ila yawele na luhala kanguhulichizaga ulonzi unojile.<verse eid="PRO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 12:16"/>Ugata wa mpoka wanguzelekaga himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:16">ila yawele na luhala kangubezaga maligo.<verse eid="PRO 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 12:17"/>Yalingulonga mbuli ya kukomya kangulavyaga ulolezi wa kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:17">ila mlolezi wa udesi kangulongaga uhadi.<verse eid="PRO 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 12:18"/>Ulonzi wihile wangulumizaga kota ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:18">ila goyalingulonga yawele na luhala ganguchidita chilonda chipone.<verse eid="PRO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 12:19"/>Mlomo ulingulonga kukomya, wangikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:19">ila umyango wa udesi ndo wa mhela uchefu hela.<verse eid="PRO 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 12:20"/>Walingiwika goya kudita gehile nawamema uhadi mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:20">ila walingikangaza kuwala kikala goya wanguwa na usangalalo.<verse eid="PRO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 12:21"/>Watanganiche hawalingufichigwa na mbuli yoneche yihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:21">ila wehile nawamema magazo menji.<verse eid="PRO 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 12:22"/>Milomo jilingulonga udesi ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:22">ila wanhu walingukundigwa ndo usangalalo wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 12:23"/>Munhu yawele na luhala kanguvisaga uwanzi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:23">ila wapoka wanguwikulaga upoka wa hewo.<verse eid="PRO 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 12:24"/>Kikangaza kwangumhaga munhu ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:24">ila ugata womdita yawe mpogozi.<verse eid="PRO 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 12:25"/>Lunhwinhwi mnhumbula ndo itunyo ikulu kwa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:25">ila ulonzi unojile wangumsangalaza.<verse eid="PRO 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 12:26"/>Munhu yawele na hachi kangilolela kuli ugoloko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:26">ila nzila ya wehile yanguwajilizaga hewo wawo.<verse eid="PRO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 12:27"/>Mpelembi mgata hopata choyalingupelemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:27">ila yalingikangaza, mbuli za heye zolutilila goya.<verse eid="PRO 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 12:28"/>Kutanganika ndo nzila ya ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:28">kuli nzila yake haduhu kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 12:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PRO 13"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 13:1"/>Mwana yawele na luhala kanguhulichizaga malajizo ga mhaza wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:1">ila yalingubeza hambe yahulichize makanyo.<verse eid="PRO 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 13:2"/>Munhu yawele na nhumbula inojile kangupataga ganojile kulawa kuli ulonzi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:2">ila wahadi wanguganaga kilewa.<verse eid="PRO 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 13:3"/>Yalinguudima mlomo wa heye kangwamilaga kikala kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:3">yalinguhabuka kangiyambuzila yuye kudumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 13:4"/>Mgata kanguwaga na maya ila hambe yapate choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:4">walingikangaza wangutambichizwaga chilyo kwa winji.<verse eid="PRO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 13:5"/>Yatanganiche kanguuzudilaga udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:5">ila mwihe kangigalaga soni na kudeula.<verse eid="PRO 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 13:6"/>Kutanganika kwanguwamilaga wagoloche nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:6">ila gehile ganguwagwisaga wehile.<verse eid="PRO 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 13:7"/>Wamwenga wangiditaga kota wana lufufu kuno wahela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:7">wanji wangiwonaga kota wazunwa kuno wana lufufu lwinji.<verse eid="PRO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 13:8"/>Lufufu lwa munhu lwoweza kumgombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:8">kulawa kwa wanhu walingugana kumhola kwa chiwalo cha kugana lufufu lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:8">ila mzunwa halingudumba kuholigwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 13:9"/>Watanganiche wangupulikaga kota chenje chilingwaka goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:9">ila wehile ndo kota chenje chilinguzima.<verse eid="PRO 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 13:10"/>Kidaya kwangwambuzaga kilewa hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:10">ila walingukunda ulonzi unojile wana luhala.<verse eid="PRO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 13:11"/>Lufufu lwa himahima lwangwajililaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:11">ila yalingukungajiza hadohado kolwonjeza.<verse eid="PRO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 13:12"/>Kitumbila kwa kubeteza ng'hatu kwangulumiza nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:12">ila kitumbila kwenele kwangigalaga kusangalala.<verse eid="PRO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 13:13"/>Yalingubeza ulonzi unojile kangigalila kudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:13">ila yalinguhulichiza mizilo kopegwa chonolo.<verse eid="PRO 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 13:14"/>Malanguso ga wawele na luhala ndo nzasa ya ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:14">gangumtanza munhu kiwika kutali na midiwa ja kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 13:15"/>Yawele na kuvizela kangigalaga uganililo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:15">ila nzila ya wehile ndo ya magazo.<verse eid="PRO 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 13:16"/>Yawele na luhala kanguditaga chila chinhu kwa nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:16">ila mpoka kanguwikaga hazelu upoka wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 13:17"/>Msenga yehile kanguwenjizaga wanhu kuli magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:17">ila msenga yalingukundigwa kangigalaga kikala goya.<verse eid="PRO 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 13:18"/>Uzunwa na kudeula vyangumpataga yalingugabeza malanguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:18">ila yalinguhulika makanyo kanguhulichizwaga.<verse eid="PRO 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 13:19"/>Kwangusangalala hala houpata chila choulingugana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:19">Wapoka wanguzudilaga kiwika kutali na wihe.<verse eid="PRO 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 13:20"/>Yalinguwa hamwe na wawele na luhala kangupataga luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:20">ila yalingilumba na wapoka kolumila.<verse eid="PRO 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 13:21"/>Walingudita gehile wanguwaga na magazo ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:21">ila watanganiche wopegwa ganojile.<verse eid="PRO 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 13:22"/>Munhu yanojile kanguwalechelaga uhalizi walelwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:22">ila lufufu lwa yawele na gehile nawawichilwa watanganiche.<verse eid="PRO 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 13:23"/>Mgunda wa mzunwa wangulavyaga mbena nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:23">ila ne hachi wanguholigwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 13:24"/>Yohambe yamzape mwanage kwa makanyo hambe yamgane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:24">ila yalingumgana mwanage kangumkanyaga kung'hali.<verse eid="PRO 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 13:25"/>Yatanganiche kanacho chilyo cha kuhega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:25">ila lida lya mwihe lyangugazika kwa nzala.<verse eid="PRO 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PRO 14"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 14:1"/>Mdala yawele na luhala kanguzengaga ng'handa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:1">ila mdala mpoka kangubomolaga kwa moko ga heye yuye.<verse eid="PRO 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 14:2"/>Yalingudita mbuli zigoloche kangumdumbaga Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:2">ila yajilile kangumbezaga Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 14:3"/>Mpoka kangigazaga yuye kwa kulonga kwa kidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:3">ila yawele na luhala kangwamilwaga kwa ulonzi wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 14:4"/>Honhu halihela misenga ja kulimila, ng'hano za munhu zahela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:4">mbena nyinji zangulawa kwa chiwalo cha mong'ho wa misenga ja kulimila.<verse eid="PRO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 14:5"/>Mlolezi yalingukundigwa hambe yalonje udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:5">ila yohambe yakundigwe kangulongaga udesi.<verse eid="PRO 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 14:6"/>Yalingubeza kangupalaga luhala na hambe yapate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:6">ila yawele na luhala kangupataga uwanzi kwa ubewe.<verse eid="PRO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 14:7"/>Wiwiche kutali na mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:7">kwa vila aho hoyawele haduhu ulonzi wa luhala.<verse eid="PRO 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 14:8"/>Luhala lwa yula yawele na nyhala lwangumlajila nzila ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:8">ila upoka wa mpoka, wangumhada heye yuye.<verse eid="PRO 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 14:9"/>Wapoka wangusechelelaga gehile ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:9">ila wagoloche nhumbula wangupataga kunoga kulawa kwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 14:10"/>Chila nhumbula yanguuzela usungu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:10">haduhu yawele yoweza kihanza kuli kusangalala kwake.<verse eid="PRO 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 14:11"/>Ng'handa ya mwihe yobomoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:11">ila ihema lya yagoloche nhumbula lyoditigwa liwe nzinzili.<verse eid="PRO 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 14:12"/>Hana nzila youlingijesa kota ya goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:12">ila kuli kuduma yoweza kukulongoza kuli kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 14:13"/>Masinzo goweza kivisa kuli kuseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:13">usangalalo woweza kumalila kuli masinzo.<verse eid="PRO 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 14:14"/>Munhu yajilile kobeta mafuza ga gala goyalingudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:14">naye yanojile kopata chonolo cha madito ga heye.<verse eid="PRO 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 14:15"/>Mpoka kangukundaga chila chinhu choyalingulonjelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:15">ila yawele na luhala kanguwaga na kilolela kuli nzila za heye.<verse eid="PRO 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 14:16"/>Yawele na luhala ndo yalingilolela na kangiwikaga kutali na wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:16">ila mpoka hambe yelemeze ne kilolela.<verse eid="PRO 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 14:17"/>Yalinguzudila himahima kanguditaga upoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:17">naye yawele na nhumbula yihile kanguzudilwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 14:18"/>Wasowile nyhala wanguhalilaga upoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:18">ila wawele na luhala wangupegwa itaji lya uwanzi.<verse eid="PRO 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 14:19"/>Walingudita gehile wofugama hali wanhu wanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:19">wehile hali lwizi lwa watanganiche.<verse eid="PRO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 14:20"/>Mzunwa kanguzudilwa mbaka na yowalingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:20">ila yawele na lufufu kana goloko wenji.<verse eid="PRO 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 14:21"/>Yalingumbeza yowalingikalasa habehi ndo yawele na gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:21">ila nakatambichizwa yawele na isungu kwa wazunwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 14:22"/>Yalingiwika goya kudita gehile, ndangukomya kanguwifya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:22">Yalingiwika goya kudita ganojile, kangupegwa igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 14:23"/>Kikangaza kuli chila mijito kwangigalaga chinhu cha mzidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:23">ila ulonzi hela wangigalaga uzunwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 14:24"/>Lufufu ndo chonolo kwa yula yawele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:24">ila upoka wa mpoka wangulelaga upoka.<verse eid="PRO 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 14:25"/>Mlolezi wa kukomya kanguuloholaga ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:25">ila yalingulonga udesi ka yalinguhada.<verse eid="PRO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 14:26"/>Yalingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi kana kitumbila kwimile nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:26">na wana wa heye wopata honhu ha kubilimila hawele na kikala goya.<verse eid="PRO 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 14:27"/>Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi ndo nzasa ya ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:27">kwangumtanza munhu kiwika kutali na midiwa ja kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 14:28"/>Lufufu lwa mndewa ndo winji wa wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:28">ila ne wanhu chilongozi kangudumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 14:29"/>Munhu yohawele wa kuzudila himahima kana luhala ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:29">ila yalinguzudila himahima kangulajilaga upoka.<verse eid="PRO 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 14:30"/>Kikala goya mnhumbula kwangumha munhu mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:30">ila maya gangujidita mizeje jole.<verse eid="PRO 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 14:31"/>Yalingumbunza mzunwa kangumliga Yamlumbile heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:31">ila yalingumonela isungu mzunwa, kangumtogola Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 14:32"/>Mwihe kangudumigwa kwa madito ga heye ga wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:32">ila yatanganiche kangwamilwa na kugoloka kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 14:33"/>Luhala lwa kwa munhu yawele na nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:33">ila hailinguzeleka hali wapoka.<verse eid="PRO 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 14:34"/>Kutanganika kwanguwadita wanhu wa isi watogoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:34">ila gehile ndo mbuli yihile kwa isi yoneche.<verse eid="PRO 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 14:35"/>Mndewa kanguwaga yomha kunoga chitumagwa yalingudita kwa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:35">ila ng'halazi ya heye yangumpataga yula yalingudita vibi.<verse eid="PRO 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PRO 15"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 15:1"/>Kwidichila kwa uliholile kwangulemeza ng'halazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:1">ila ulonzi ung'hang'hale wangonjeza ng'halazi.<verse eid="PRO 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 15:2"/>Umyango wa yawele na luhala wanguutogolaga uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:2">ila mlomo wa mpoka wangulavyaga upoka.<verse eid="PRO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 15:3"/>Meho ga Mkulu Nguluwi gangonaga chila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:3">ganguwapugajizaga yanojile na yehile.<verse eid="PRO 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 15:4"/>Umyango uwele liholile ndo mwaluko wa ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:4">ila mlomo wajilile wangutwegulaga nhumbula.<verse eid="PRO 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 15:5"/>Mpoka kangubezaga malanguso ga mhaza wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:5">ila yalingukunda makanyo ndo msugu.<verse eid="PRO 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 15:6"/>Kaye kwa yatanganiche hana lufufu lwinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:6">ila choyalingupata mwihe changumigalila magazo.<verse eid="PRO 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 15:7"/>Mlomo wa yawele na luhala wangweneza uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:7">ila haiwele ahyo kuli nhumbula ya mpoka.<verse eid="PRO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 15:8"/>Nhambiko ya wehile ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:8">ila kulanda kwa wagoloche nhumbula kwangumsangalaza Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 15:9"/>Madito ga wehile ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:9">ila Nguluwi kanguwaganaga walinguwinza mbuli za kutanganika.<verse eid="PRO 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 15:10"/>Magazo gang'hang'hale ndo kwa chiwalo cha yalinguleka madito ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:10">yoneche yalinguzudila kukanyigwa kobagama.<verse eid="PRO 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 15:11"/>Wone Mkulu Nguluwi kangugazela ga kuli Kubagama na ga kuli Kudumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:11">ndaze, majesa ga wanhu goweza kivisa hali heye?<verse eid="PRO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 15:12"/>Yalingubeza hambe yagane kukanyigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:12">hambe yapale utanzi kwa yawele na luhala.<verse eid="PRO 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 15:13"/>Nhumbula iwele na kusangalala yangukudita kumeho kupuliche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:13">ila usungu wangutwegula nhumbula.<verse eid="PRO 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 15:14"/>Yawele na luhala kangupalaga uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:14">ila mpoka kangulyaga upoka.<verse eid="PRO 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 15:15"/>Kwa yalingubunzwa chila zuwa ndo liha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:15">ila kwa yawele na nhumbula ilingusangalala ndo mnvina yohambe imale.<verse eid="PRO 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 15:16"/>Fola kuwa na chido na kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:16">kusinda kuwa na ng'hano nyinji hamwe na magazo.<verse eid="PRO 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 15:17"/>Fola chilyo cha ibwasi na kuwa na igano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:17">kusinda mnvina ya iwunde linyatile na kuwa na kuzudila.<verse eid="PRO 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 15:18"/>Munhu wa ng'halazi kangwambuzaga kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:18">ila yula yawele halinguzudila himahima, kangukudita kilewa kusindamale.<verse eid="PRO 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 15:19"/>Nzila ya mgata naimema miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:19">ila ya yula yagoloche nhumbula ya hazelu kota nzila ng'hulu.<verse eid="PRO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 15:20"/>Mwana yawele na luhala kangumditaga mhaza wa heye yasangalale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:20">ila mpoka kangumbezaga mayake.<verse eid="PRO 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 15:21"/>Upoka ndo usangalalo kwa mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:21">ila yalinguvizela goya kanguhagulaga nzila iwele goya.<verse eid="PRO 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 15:22"/>Majesa ga kudita chinhu ganguwifigwa wone hawe haduhu utanzi kulawa kwa wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:22">ila wone hawe na wanhu wenji wa kutanza, majesa ago gosumya.<verse eid="PRO 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 15:23"/>Munhu kanguwaga na usangalalo wone yedichile goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:23">ulonzi unojile kwa mhela wake ndo unoga lukami.<verse eid="PRO 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 15:24"/>Nzila ya yawele na luhala yanguluta kuchanya kuli ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:24">leka yewiche kutali na kwinjila hasi kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="PRO 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 15:25"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangubomolaga ng'handa za wala walingidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:25">ila kangwamilaga mbaka ja haluga ha wadala wafililwe na walume wawo.<verse eid="PRO 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 15:26"/>Majesa ga mwihe ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:26">ila ulonzi wa isungu ndo welile.<verse eid="PRO 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 15:27"/>Munhu yawele na maya ga sendi, kanguligalilaga magazo ivyazi lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:27">ila yalinguzudila kupegwa chinhu choneche kwa uviso, kochikala.<verse eid="PRO 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 15:28"/>Nhumbula ya yatanganiche yangijesa kung'hali kwidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:28">ila mlomo wa mwihe wangulongaga wihe.<verse eid="PRO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 15:29"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ka kutali na wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:29">ila kanguhulichiza kulanda kwa watanganiche.<verse eid="PRO 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 15:30"/>Meho ga isungu gangusangalaza nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:30">mbuli inojile yangusangalaza lukuli.<verse eid="PRO 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 15:31"/>Munhu yalinguhulichiza makanyo ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:31">kana honhu hake hali wawele na luhala.<verse eid="PRO 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 15:32"/>Yalingulema kulanguswa kangibeza yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:32">ila yalingukunda makanyo kowa na luhala.<verse eid="PRO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 15:33"/>Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi ndo malanguso ga luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:33">kung'hali kutogoligwa yanguganigwa kuwa ulingunyenyetela.<verse eid="PRO 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PRO 16"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 16:1"/>Munhu kangijesaga kudita mbuli zoyogana heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:1">ila ulonzi wa kuduma ndo wa heye Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 16:2"/>Madito ga munhu gangonekaga kwa heye kota ga goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:2">ila Mkulu Nguluwi kangujezaga kunuwila kwa munhu.<verse eid="PRO 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 16:3"/>Umhe Mkulu Nguluwi choneche choulingudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:3">na mbuli za hegwe zokulutila goya.<verse eid="PRO 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 16:4"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalumba chila chinhu kwa kunuwila kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:4">mbaka wehile kwa chiwalo cha zuwa lya kudumya.<verse eid="PRO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 16:5"/>Chila yalingidaya ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:5">ndangukomya, munhu kota ayo kogazigwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 16:6"/>Kwa igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa, munhu kanguditilwaga uhanyisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:6">kwa kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi, kangiwikaga kutali na wihe.<verse eid="PRO 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 16:7"/>Wone Mkulu Nguluwi yanojezwe na madito ga munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:7">kanguwagalamulaga mbaka wang'honyo wa heye wanguwa goloko.<verse eid="PRO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 16:8"/>Fola lufufu ludo kuli kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:8">kusinda kuwa na vinji kuli wihe.<verse eid="PRO 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 16:9"/>Munhu koweza kudita goyalingijesa kudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:9">ila Mkulu Nguluwi kangulongozaga chila choyalingudita.<verse eid="PRO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 16:10"/>Mndewa kangwamulaga kwa kulongozwa na Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:10">hoyolavya utaguso hambe yawifye.<verse eid="PRO 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 16:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kanguganaga vipimilo na mizani ja hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:11">vipimilo vyeng'ha vya mizani kuli chihako cha kupimila, ndo mijito ja heye.<verse eid="PRO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 16:12"/>Ndo izudizo wandewa kudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:12">kwa vila misisi ja ludali lwa hewo ndo hachi.<verse eid="PRO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 16:13"/>Mndewa kanguganaga munhu yalingulonga kwa kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:13">kangumganaga munhu yalingulonga kwa hachi.<verse eid="PRO 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 16:14"/>Ng'halazi ya mndewa ndo kota msenga wa kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:14">munhu yawele na luhala koidita isindamale.<verse eid="PRO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 16:15"/>Wone kumeho kwa mndewa kupuliche, hana ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:15">kunoga kwa heye ndo kota ng'hungugu ya luhela.<verse eid="PRO 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 16:16"/>Kuwa na luhala ndo kunoga kusinda zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:16">kupata nyhala ndo kuhagula kunojile kusinda sendi.<verse eid="PRO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 16:17"/>Nzila ya wagoloche nhumbula yangiwikaga kutali na wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:17">yalingwamila nzila ya heye, kangwamilaga kikala kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 16:18"/>Kidaya kwangulongolaga kudumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:18">nhumbula ya kidaya yangulongolaga kugwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 16:19"/>Fola kuwa ulingunyenyetela na mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:19">kusinda kihanza vinhu vya kuboka na walingidaya.<verse eid="PRO 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 16:20"/>Yalingibatilila malanguso, mbuli za heye zomlutila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:20">kotambichizwa munhu yalingitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 16:21"/>Yawele na luhala mnhumbula kanguchemigwa yawele na nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:21">ulonzi wa kunojeza wanguwakwega wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 16:22"/>Luhala ndo nzasa ya ukomu kwa yawele nalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:22">ila upoka ndo kuzapigwa kwa wapoka.<verse eid="PRO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 16:23"/>Nhumbula ya yawele na luhala yangumditaga yalonje kwa kilolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:23">yanguuditaga ulonzi wa heye uwe wa kukwega wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 16:24"/>Ulonzi wa isungu ndo kota hanombwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:24">ndo unona kuli nhumbula na una mong'ho kuli lukuli.<verse eid="PRO 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 16:25"/>Hana nzila youlingijesa kota ya goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:25">ila kuli kuduma yoweza kukulongoza kuli kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 16:26"/>Kugana chilyo kwangumdita mkola mijito yekangaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:26">kwa vila nzala yangumdita yalutilile.<verse eid="PRO 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 16:27"/>Mjuvi kangijesaga kudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:27">ulonzi wa heye ndo kota chiluli ching'hang'hale.<verse eid="PRO 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 16:28"/>Munhu yajilile kangwenezaga kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:28">yalinguheha kanguwaditaga wanhu webagule na goloko.<verse eid="PRO 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 16:29"/>Munhu yawele na nhumbula yihile, kangumhada munhu yowalingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:29">kangumlongozaga kuli nzila yihile.<verse eid="PRO 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 16:30"/>Yalingukonyeza kwa wihe kangijesa kudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:30">na yohambe yagane kulonga, kangunuwila kudita gehile.<verse eid="PRO 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 16:31"/>Kuwa na mbuliza za usekulu ndo itaji lya ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:31">lyangulawa kuli kikala kwa kutanganika.<verse eid="PRO 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 16:32"/>Yohawele mbewe wa kuzudila ndo kanoga kusinda yawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:32">yalinguilongoza nhumbula ya heye yuye ndo kanoga kusinda yula yalinguuhola muji kwa lupichi.<verse eid="PRO 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 16:33"/>Simbi yangutowigwa leka kuvizela goyolawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:33">ila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yalingwamula chila chinhu.<verse eid="PRO 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PRO 17"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 17:1"/>Fola ibumunda likalile kuli kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:1">kusinda mnvina kuli ng'handa ya kilewa.<verse eid="PRO 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 17:2"/>Chitumagwa yawele na luhala, kohola honhu ha mwana mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:2">leka yawe na honhu ha kuhalila ha ivyazi alyo.<verse eid="PRO 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 17:3"/>Zahabu ama sendi zangwelizwa kwa chiluli kuli itanulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:3">ila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yalingweliza nhumbula za wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 17:4"/>Yalingudita wihe kanguhulichizaga ulonzi wihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:4">mdesi kanguhulichizaga umyango wa uhadi.<verse eid="PRO 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 17:5"/>Yalingumbeza mzunwa kangumliga Yamlumbile heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:5">yalingusangalalila kutunya kogazigwa.<verse eid="PRO 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 17:6"/>Wazukulu ndo itaji lya wasekulu wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:6">wana ndo lutogo lwa mhaza na mamo wa hewo.<verse eid="PRO 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 17:7"/>Ulonzi unojile hauwele hihi hela hali mlomo wa mjuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:7">ila ndo vibi ng'hatu kwa chilongozi kulonga ulonzi wa udesi!<verse eid="PRO 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 17:8"/>Kwa yalingulavya vinhu kwa uviso, kudita ahyo ndo kota subala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:8">kangijesa kota mbuli za heye zolutilila goya.<verse eid="PRO 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 17:9"/>Yalingulechela gehile kangulutiliza igano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:9">ila yalingukumbusila nongwa kangubagulaga goloko.<verse eid="PRO 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 17:10"/>Makanyo kwa wawele na luhala gana mana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:10">kusinda mitowa miya imwe kwa wapoka.<verse eid="PRO 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 17:11"/>Choyalingudita munhu yehile ndo kubelenhuka hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:11">msenga yang'hang'hale kolajizwa kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 17:12"/>Fola kiting'hana na isimba idala ling'hang'hale lisukuligwe wanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:12">kusinda kiting'hana na mpoka kuli upoka wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 17:13"/>Yalinguhilula gehile kwa ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:13">gehile hagokuka mng'handa ya heye.<verse eid="PRO 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 17:14"/>Kwaluchiza kilewa ndo kota kutula izimbo lya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:14">lelo, uleche kudita ahyo, kung'hali kitwanza hakunakwaluka.<verse eid="PRO 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 17:15"/>Kumlechela yawele na nongwa na kumgaza yalihela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:15">geng'ha meli ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 17:16"/>Lekachoni mpoka yawe na sendi mmoko ga kugulila luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:16">kuno heye yuye kahela nyhala?<verse eid="PRO 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 17:17"/>Goloko kanguganaga mazuwa geng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:17">mwenyelukolo kangupondigwa kwa chiwalo cha utanzi mhela wa magazo.<verse eid="PRO 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 17:18"/>Haiwele mbuli ya nyhala kuwika lehani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:18">na kiwika lehani honhu ha munhu yunji.<verse eid="PRO 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 17:19"/>Yalingugana kilewa kangugana gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:19">yalingidaya kangipalila kudumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 17:20"/>Yawele na nhumbula yajilile, mbuli za heye haziwa goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:20">na yalingulonga udesi, kangufikwaga na magazo.<verse eid="PRO 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 17:21"/>Mwana mpoka ndo masinzo kwa mhaza wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:21">na usangalalo wa haduhu kwa mhaza wa mpoka.<verse eid="PRO 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 17:22"/>Nhumbula ilingusangalala ndo mikwandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:22">ila nhumbula iwele na masinzo yangwambuza lukuli luwe ng'hochele.<verse eid="PRO 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 17:23"/>Yehile kangubochelaga vinhu kwa uviso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:23">leka yajilize hachi.<verse eid="PRO 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 17:24"/>Choyalingugana yawele na luhala, ndo nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:24">ila mpoka kangugana chila chinhu muisi.<verse eid="PRO 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 17:25"/>Mwana mpoka ndo masinzo kwa mhaza wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:25">na usungu kwa mayake yampondile.<verse eid="PRO 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 17:26"/>Haiwele goya kumdita munhu yalihela nongwa yalipe faini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:26">ama kuwatowa wang'hangala kwa chiwalo cha kugoloka kwa hewo.<verse eid="PRO 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 17:27"/>Yalingijesa yang'hali kulonga, kana luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:27">munhu yawele liholile ndo yawele na nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 17:28"/>Wone mpoka yanyamalile, kangonekaga kota kana luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:28">wone yadinye mlomo wa heye, kangonekaga kota yawele na nyhala.<verse eid="PRO 17:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PRO 18"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 18:1"/>Yalingupala ga heye hela kangibagulaga na wayage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:1">kanguzudilaga wone yalonjelwe choneche chiwele na luhala.<verse eid="PRO 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 18:2"/>Mpoka hambe yanojezwe na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:2">kwa heye kulonga choyalingijesa ndo chinojile.<verse eid="PRO 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 18:3"/>Vyoukuya wihe, kwanguyaga na kubeza kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:3">hamwe na soni, kwanguyaga na kudeula.<verse eid="PRO 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 18:4"/>Ulonzi wa munhu ndo mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:4">ila nzasa ya luhala ndo kazanda kalinguchililika.<verse eid="PRO 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 18:5"/>Haiwele goya kumganilila mwihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:5">na kumbunza hachi yatanganiche.<verse eid="PRO 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 18:6"/>Ulonzi wa mpoka wangigalaga kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:6">chila choyalingulonga changwambuzaga mitowa.<verse eid="PRO 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 18:7"/>Mlomo wa mpoka wangumdumyaga heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:7">mlomo wa heye ndo idiwa lya kikala kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 18:8"/>Ulonzi wa munhu yalinguheha ndo kota chilyo chinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:8">chiwele changudulikaga du mbaka mmunda.<verse eid="PRO 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 18:9"/>Munhu mgata kuli mijito ja heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:9">mng'holoze ndo yalinguwifya.<verse eid="PRO 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 18:10"/>Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ngome iwele nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:10">yatanganiche kangulibilimilaga na kanguwaga hali kikala goya.<verse eid="PRO 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 18:11"/>Lufufu lwa yawele na lufufu ndo ngome ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:11">kangijesa kota ndo lukanzi luwele ng'wemang'wema lulingumwamila.<verse eid="PRO 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 18:12"/>Kidaya kwa mnhumbula kwangigalaga kudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:12">ila kunyenyetela kwangigalaga lutogo.<verse eid="PRO 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 18:13"/>Yalingwidichila kuno yang'hali kuhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:13">ndo upoka na mbuli ya soni kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 18:14"/>Nhumbula ya munhu yanguwezaga kwimilila utamwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:14">ila wone itweguche, yokwimilila ndaze?<verse eid="PRO 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 18:15"/>Munhu yawele na nyhala kangulutililaga kilangusa kuwala uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:15">ikutu lya yawele na luhala lyangupalaga uwanzi.<verse eid="PRO 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 18:16"/>Ndolendole yangumchumulilaga nzila yalingulavya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:16">yangumigalaga hali wakulu.<verse eid="PRO 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 18:17"/>Yalingilewela tandi kangonekaga yalingulonga kwa kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:17">mbaka aho yowalingitwanza na heye hoyokwaluka kumuuza.<verse eid="PRO 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 18:18"/>Kutowa simbi ndo kwanguduma kitwanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:18">kwangwamula hali wakulu walingitwanza.<verse eid="PRO 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 18:19"/>Mwenyelukolo yaditilwe gehile, kana nhumbula igagadale kusinda lukanzi lwa muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:19">nako kitwanza ndo kota lwizi lwa ngome luwele na mhajilo.<verse eid="PRO 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 18:20"/>Ulonzi wa munhu wanguweza kumgutiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:20">kangigutiza mafuza kulawa kuli ulonzi wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 18:21"/>Umyango una mong'ho wa kigala ukomu ama kukopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:21">walingugana kuukolela mijito wolya mafuza gake.<verse eid="PRO 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 18:22"/>Yalingumpata mche nakapata chinhu chinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:22">ako ndo kunoga kulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 18:23"/>Wazunwa wangulandaga kwa kunyenyetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:23">ila yawele na lufufu kangwidichilaga kwa kung'hang'hala.<verse eid="PRO 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 18:24"/>Goloko wenji wanguweza kumgwisa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:24">ila kabaho goloko yalingukundigwa kusinda mwenyelukolo.<verse eid="PRO 18:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PRO 19"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 19:1"/>Fola mzunwa yalingikala kwa kugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:1">kusinda yajilile kwa ulonzi na mpoka.<verse eid="PRO 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 19:2"/>Hainojile munhu kuwa na maya ne kuwa na uwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:2">ne kudita himahima kwa vila koileka nzila.<verse eid="PRO 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 19:3"/>Wone munhu yedumye kwa upoka wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:3">kangumzudilaga Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 19:4"/>Lufufu lwangigalaga wagoloko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:4">ila mzunwa kangulechigwa ne goloko.<verse eid="PRO 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 19:5"/>Mlolezi mdesi holeka kugazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:5">yalingulonga udesi howeza kiwika kutali na magazo.<verse eid="PRO 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 19:6"/>Wanhu wenji wanguganaga kuwa habehi na wang'hangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:6">chila munhu kanguganaga yawe goloko wa munhu yalingulavya ndolendole.<verse eid="PRO 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 19:7"/>Mzunwa kanguzudilwa na wang'holoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:7">goloko wa heye ndo mzidi, wangumbilimaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:7">Hanga kanguwawinzaga kwa kuwadedeza, ila hawalingoneka honeche.<verse eid="PRO 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 19:8"/>Yalingupata luhala kangigana yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:8">yalingibatilila kuvizela kwa heye, kowa goya.<verse eid="PRO 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 19:9"/>Mlolezi mdesi holeka kugazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:9">yalingulonga udesi kodumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 19:10"/>Haiwa goya kwa mpoka kuwa na lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:10">ndo vibi ng'hatu kwa mpogozi kuwalongoza wakulu.<verse eid="PRO 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 19:11"/>Yawele na luhala halinguzudila himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:11">kulechela nongwa ndo lutogo kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 19:12"/>Kuzudila kwa mndewa ndo kota kubuma kwa isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:12">ila kunoga kwa heye ndo kota nungwi kuli misolo.<verse eid="PRO 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 19:13"/>Mwana mpoka ndo kubagama kwa mhaza wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:13">na kilewa kwa mche ndo kota midovu ja nhonya johambe jimale.<verse eid="PRO 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 19:14"/>Ng'handa na lufufu ndo uhalizi woyalingupata munhu kulawa kwa wasekulu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:14">ila mche yawele na luhala kangulawaga kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 19:15"/>Ugata ndo kota usinjizi unonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:15">munhu mgata kogazika kwa nzala.<verse eid="PRO 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 19:16"/>Yalingibatilila mizilo kangukuwika kikala kwa heye kuwe kwa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:16">yalingubeza ilajizo kobagama.<verse eid="PRO 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 19:17"/>Yalingumtanza mzunwa kangumwazichila Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:17">Mkulu Nguluwi komlipa kwa madito ga heye ganojile.<verse eid="PRO 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 19:18"/>Mkanye mwanago mhela kitumbila kung'hali baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:18">ila wone uleche kudita ahyo ndo kota kumdumya.<verse eid="PRO 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 19:19"/>Munhu yalinguzudila ng'hatu yangumlapa yapegwe magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:19">wone umlohole kamwe, yokulapa umlohole kahi.<verse eid="PRO 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 19:20"/>Uhulichize ulonzi unojile na kubochela malanguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:20">leka uwe na luhala lwa kukutanza mazuwa galinguya.<verse eid="PRO 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 19:21"/>Kuli mutwi wa munhu hana majesa menji ga kudita chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:21">ila choyalingunuwila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo choditigwa.<verse eid="PRO 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 19:22"/>Chilinguganigwa kwa munhu ndo igano lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:22">fola mzunwa kusinda mdesi.<verse eid="PRO 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 19:23"/>Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi kwangigalaga ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:23">yalingumdumba kangutambichizwaga kwesela ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:23">hofichigwa na chihile choneche.<verse eid="PRO 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 19:24"/>Mgata kanguwikaga moko wa heye kuli luhelo lwa chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:24">ila ndo mgata lukami mbaka kangulemwela kwinula moko wa heye kuhilika kumlomo.<verse eid="PRO 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 19:25"/>Mgaze yalingubeza, naye yalihela nyhala kochilangusa kuwa na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:25">mkanye yawele na luhala, naye kowa na uwanzi.<verse eid="PRO 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 19:26"/>Yalingumtowa mhaza wa heye na kumuwinga mayake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:26">ndo mwana yalingigala soni na kudeula.<verse eid="PRO 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 19:27"/>Mwana wa heni, wone uleche kuhulichiza malanguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:27">kowa kutali na ulonzi wa luhala.<verse eid="PRO 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 19:28"/>Mlolezi yohambe yatanze chinhu kangubezaga hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:28">na umyango wa mwihe wanguugana unojenoje wa wihe.<verse eid="PRO 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 19:29"/>Magazo nagawichigwa goya kwa walingubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:29">ng'hobwa za ngozi naziwichigwa goya kwa kuwatowa wapoka kuli migongo.<verse eid="PRO 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PRO 20"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 20:1"/>Divai yangigalaga kubeza na ujimbi wangigalaga kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:1">yoneche yalingugala kahela luhala.<verse eid="PRO 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 20:2"/>Kuzudila ng'hatu kwa mndewa ndo kota isimba lilingubuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:2">yalingumzudiza kangukuwika kikala kwa heye hali honhu hehile.<verse eid="PRO 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 20:3"/>Ndo mbuli inojile kiwika kutali na kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:3">wapoka ndo walingilewa.<verse eid="PRO 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 20:4"/>Mgata hambe yalime mhela wa kulima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:4">mhela wa mbena kopala, ila hopata choneche.<verse eid="PRO 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 20:5"/>Majesa ga munhu nagavisigwa kota mgati ng'hatu mwa mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:5">ila munhu yawele na luhala kogadeha kulawa amo.<verse eid="PRO 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 20:6"/>Wanhu wenji wangidayilaga kuwa wawele na igano lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:6">ila yalingukundigwa wa kukomya kakohi?<verse eid="PRO 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 20:7"/>Wone yatanganiche yekale kwa kugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:7">wanage wotambichizwa.<verse eid="PRO 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 20:8"/>Mndewa yanojile hoyokalisa kulavya utaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:8">kanguyugululaga gehile geng'ha kwa meho ga heye.<verse eid="PRO 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 20:9"/>Whaani yojeza kulonga, “Ndiiyeliza nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:9">ndahela gehile?”<verse eid="PRO 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 20:10"/>Mizani ja uhadi na vipimilo vya uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:10">vyeng'ha ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 20:11"/>Mwana kanguzelekaga kwa kiwhana na vyoyawele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:11">wone madito ga heye ndo ganoga na nagagoloka.<verse eid="PRO 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 20:12"/>Ikutu lilinguhulika na iziho lilingulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:12">vyeng'ha vili nakavidita Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 20:13"/>Uleche kugana kuwasa hela leka uleche kuwa mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:13">uwe meho nagwe kowa na chilyo chinji.<verse eid="PRO 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 20:14"/>“Hainojile, hainojile,” yalingugula kangung'ung'utaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:14">ila wone yoche kangitogolaga nakapunguzilwa beyi.<verse eid="PRO 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 20:15"/>Hana zahabu na winji wa maganga ga sendi nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:15">ila cha kutanza ng'hatu ndo ulonzi wa luhala.<verse eid="PRO 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 20:16"/>Wone munhu yelahe hali hegwe kota komuwichila lehani mjenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:16">uhole ivalo lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:16">leka yalipe sendi kwa vila nakamuwichila lehani ayo mjenzi.<verse eid="PRO 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 20:17"/>Chilyo chilinguya kwa uhadi ndo chinona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:17">ila hamba changuwaga kota sangalaza kumlomo.<verse eid="PRO 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 20:18"/>Kuwika goya mbuli, kwangukolekaga kwa kulongasa hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:18">wone kwangugana kwaluka kitowa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:18">yangulapigwa kubochela majesa kulawa kwa wanji.<verse eid="PRO 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 20:19"/>Yalinguheha hambe yavise chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:19">ahyo wiwiche kutali na munhu yalinguhabuka.<verse eid="PRO 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 20:20"/>Yalingumpanjila mhaza wa heye ama mayake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:20">lumuli lwa ukomu wa heye lozimigwa kota chenje kuli jiza totolo.<verse eid="PRO 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 20:21"/>Uhalizi wuyile himahima mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:21">wahela utambichizo kuli kuduma.<verse eid="PRO 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 20:22"/>Uleche kulonga, “Ndohilusa wihe wonditilwe.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:22">Witumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi naye kokulohola.<verse eid="PRO 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 20:23"/>Mizani ya uhadi ndo izudizo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:23">na vipimilo vyohavikundigwe havilingumnojeza.<verse eid="PRO 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 20:24"/>Majendo ga munhu gangulongozwaga na Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:24">munhu koweza ndaze kuizela nzila ya kuluta?<verse eid="PRO 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 20:25"/>Ndo idiwa kwa munhu kuchiwika chinhu chiuyeng'ha himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:25">hamba kijesa kahi kuwala chilaho cha heye.<verse eid="PRO 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 20:26"/>Mndewa yawele na luhala kanguwayugululaga wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:26">kanguwagazaga ne isungu.<verse eid="PRO 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 20:27"/>Muhe wa munhu ndo chenje cha Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:27">kangupugajizaga nhumbula ya munhu mbaka mgati ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 20:28"/>Igano lya kwimilila na kukundigwa vyangumwamilaga mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:28">ulongozi wa heye wangukangazwa kwa igano lya kwimilila.<verse eid="PRO 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 20:29"/>Lutogo lwa wasongolo ndo mong'ho wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:29">kunoga kwa wasekulu ndo mbuliza.<verse eid="PRO 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 20:30"/>Mitowa jilingulumiza ndo mikwandi ja kusa wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:30">ng'hobwa zangwelizaga nhumbula mbaka mgati ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 20:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PRO 21"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 21:1"/>Nhumbula ya mndewa ndo kota mazi galinguchililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:1">Mkulu Nguluwi, kanguilongozaga honeche hoyogana.<verse eid="PRO 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 21:2"/>Madito geng'ha ga munhu gangoneka ga goya kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:2">ila Mkulu Nguluwi kanguipimaga nhumbula.<verse eid="PRO 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 21:3"/>Kudita mbuli zitanganiche na za hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:3">kwangumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi kusinda nhambiko.<verse eid="PRO 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 21:4"/>Meho ga ujuvi na nhumbula ya kidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:4">vyangulajila hazelu gehile ga wehile.<verse eid="PRO 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 21:5"/>Gala goyodita munhu kwa kwimilila gangigala lufufu kwa winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:5">ila galinguditigwa himahima ganguwa hihi hela.<verse eid="PRO 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 21:6"/>Ng'hano ilinguya kwa uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:6">ndo ivuche lilingukola na idiwa lya kubagama.<verse eid="PRO 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 21:7"/>Kilewa kwa wehile kokusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:7">kwa vila wangulema kudita mbuli za hachi.<verse eid="PRO 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 21:8"/>Nzila ya munhu yawele na nongwa ndo ya kwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:8">ila madito ga yanojile nagagoloka.<verse eid="PRO 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 21:9"/>Fola kikala hafungo mchanya mwa chinduwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:9">kusinda kikala kaye hamwe na mche yalingugana kilewa.<verse eid="PRO 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 21:10"/>Choyalingugana kudita mwihe ndo wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:10">kahela isungu mbaka kwa munhu yowalingikalasa habehi.<verse eid="PRO 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 21:11"/>Wone umgaze yalingubeza, mpoka kanguwaga na kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:11">wone umlanguse yawele na luhala, kwangumha uwanzi.<verse eid="PRO 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 21:12"/>Nguluwi kangugazela galingukoleka kuli ng'handa za wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:12">naye kowadumya walingudita gehile.<verse eid="PRO 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 21:13"/>Yalingulema kuhulichiza chililo cha wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:13">naye kahi hohulichizwa hoyolanda utanzi.<verse eid="PRO 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 21:14"/>Ng'halazi yanguditigwa isindamale kwa ndolendole ya uviso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:14">chinhu choyalingupegwa munhu kuno chivisigwa changulemeza kuzudila.<verse eid="PRO 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 21:15"/>Wone hachi iditigwe, wanhu watanganiche wosangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:15">ila wanhu wehile wokabuswa.<verse eid="PRO 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 21:16"/>Munhu yalingulubaluba kutali na nzila ya luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:16">kowasa kuli chilundo cha wabagame.<verse eid="PRO 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 21:17"/>Yalinguwinza maya ga heye kowa mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:17">yalingugana divai na mafuta ga mzeituni howa na lufufu.<verse eid="PRO 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 21:18"/>Mwihe kanguwika goya mbuli zihile kwa yatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:18">ila kangiyambuzila magazo honhu ha yagoloche.<verse eid="PRO 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 21:19"/>Fola kikala kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:19">kusinda kikala na mche yalingugana kilewa na yalingutunya.<verse eid="PRO 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 21:20"/>Kaye kwa yawele na luhala hana ng'hano ya sendi nyinji na mafuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:20">ila lufufu lwa mpoka lwangumala himahima.<verse eid="PRO 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 21:21"/>Yalingupala kutanganika na isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:21">kochikala ng'hatu na mbuli za heye zolutilila goya na kutogoligwa.<verse eid="PRO 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 21:22"/>Yawele na luhala koweza kuboka muji wa yawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:22">na kubomola ngome yowalingitumbila.<verse eid="PRO 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 21:23"/>Yalingwamila mlomo na umyango wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:23">kangiwikaga kutali na magazo.<verse eid="PRO 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 21:24"/>Yalingidaya na mjuvi, itagwa lya heye ndo “Kubeza,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:24">madito ga heye nagamema kidaya kwa ujuvi wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 21:25"/>Mgata kangubagama kwa kulemwela kweneza maya ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:25">kwa vila moko ga heye gangulema kukola mijito.<verse eid="PRO 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 21:26"/>Nemisi yeng'ha kanguganaga kuwa na chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:26">ila yatanganiche kangulavyaga kwa isungu.<verse eid="PRO 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 21:27"/>Nhambiko ya mwihe ndo izudizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:27">yanguzudiza ng'hatu wone yalavye kwa kunuwila kwihile.<verse eid="PRO 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 21:28"/>Mlolezi mdesi kodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:28">ila yalingulonga ulonzi wa kukomya howeza kulonjelwa yanyamalile.<verse eid="PRO 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 21:29"/>Mwihe kangulajilaga kota ka yazidahe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:29">ila yagoloche kangutawizaga kota nakadita goya.<verse eid="PRO 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 21:30"/>Haduhu luhala na uwanzi ne ulonzi unojile wa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:30">uwele woweza kumsumya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 21:31"/>Falasi kanguwichigwa goya kwa kitowa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:31">ila kusumya kwangitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 21:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PRO 22"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 22:1"/>Fola kuzeleka goya kusinda lufufu lwinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:1">fola kuganililwa kusinda sendi ama zahabu.<verse eid="PRO 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 22:2"/>Wawele na lufufu na wazunwa wangiwhana hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:2">Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yawalumbile hewo weng'ha.<verse eid="PRO 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 22:3"/>Yawele na luhala kanguzonaga mbuli zihile na kivisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:3">ila mpoka kangiwikaga kumwando na kulumizwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 22:4"/>Kunyenyetela na kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:4">kwangigalaga lufufu na lutogo na ukomu.<verse eid="PRO 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 22:5"/>Nzila ya mwihe naimema miwa na midiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:5">yalingugana kuwamila ukomu wa heye kochiwika kutali na nzila ayo.<verse eid="PRO 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 22:6"/>Umlanguse mwana ndaze vyoilinguganigwa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:6">naye hosemwa mbaka kuli usekulu.<verse eid="PRO 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 22:7"/>Yawele na lufufu kangumlongozaga mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:7">yalingulanda ndo mpogozi wa yalingulavya.<verse eid="PRO 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 22:8"/>Yalingunyala kubunza kobeta lihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:8">ludali lwa ng'halazi ya heye lobenigwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 22:9"/>Yawele na isungu kotambichizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:9">kwa vila chilyo cha heye kangumgawilaga mzunwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 22:10"/>Muwinje yalingubeza, ivuche lyokwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:10">kilewa na maligo vyomala.<verse eid="PRO 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 22:11"/>Yalingugana nhumbula inojile na yalingugana ulonzi wa isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:11">kowa goloko wa mndewa.<verse eid="PRO 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 22:12"/>Mkulu Nguluwi kangwamilaga malanguso ga kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:12">ila kanguuwifyaga ulonzi wa yalingubelenhuka.<verse eid="PRO 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 22:13"/>Mgata kangulongaga, “Siweza kuluta kunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:13">kuna isimba ako, lyong'hopola kuli nzila ng'hulu.”<verse eid="PRO 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 22:14"/>Mlomo wa mng'hondwa ndo ikulubila liwele ng'wemang'wema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:14">yalinguzudilwa na Mkulu Nguluwi kogwila amo.<verse eid="PRO 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 22:15"/>Mwana kanguganaga mbuli za chipoka mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:15">ila ng'hobwa ya magazo yangumusilaga ago.<verse eid="PRO 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 22:16"/>Yalingumbunza mzunwa leka kiyonjezela lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:16">na yalingumha ndolendole yawele na lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:16">weng'ha wowa wazunwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi wa wawele na luhala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 22:17"/>Uwiche goya ikutu leka uhulichize ulonzi wa wawele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:17">wijese ng'hatu kuwala uwanzi wa heni.<verse eid="PRO 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 22:18"/>Hegwe kosangalala wone kogawika mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:18">na kugakumbuchila chila mhela.<verse eid="PRO 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 22:19"/>Ila kitumbila kwa hegwe kuwe kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:19">ndangukulangusa lehano.<verse eid="PRO 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 22:20"/>Nandikwandichila nhelo makumi gadatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:20">nhelo za makanyo na uwanzi,<verse eid="PRO 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 22:21"/>leka kukulangusa gawele ga hachi na ga kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:21">na wone munhu yakuuze, umwidichile goya.<verse eid="PRO 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 22:22"/>Uleche kumbunza mzunwa kwa vila ka mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:22">umhe hachi ya heye kuli chitala,<verse eid="PRO 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 22:23"/>kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi komlewela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:23">kowasukula ukomu wa hewo walinguwabunza wayawo.<verse eid="PRO 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 22:24"/>Uleche kuwa habehi na yalinguzudila himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:24">ne kuwa hamwe na yawele na ng'halazi ya himahima,<verse eid="PRO 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 22:25"/>leka uleche kilangusa madito ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:25">na kigwiliza ng'hatu kuli idiwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 22:26"/>Uleche kuwa yumwe wa wala walinguwika kulagana kumlipila yunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:26">wanhu wawele wangiwikaga lehani kwa chiwalo cha kudaigwa kwa wanhu wanji.<verse eid="PRO 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 22:27"/>Wone uwe ulihela chinhu cha kulipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:27">chinhanda choulinguwasila choholigwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 22:28"/>Uleche kusa ulajilo wa mbaka ja katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:28">jiwele najiwichigwa na wasekulu wa hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 22:29"/>Ndaze, hana munhu yawele na uwanzi kuli mijito ja heye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:29">Ayo kowakolela mijito wandewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:29">howakolela mijito wanhu wa hihi hela.<verse eid="PRO 22:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PRO 23"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 23:1"/>Wone wikalise na kulya hamwe na chilongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:1">uleche kusemwa ne hado kota chilyo chiwele hali hegwe ndo cha chilongozi.<verse eid="PRO 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 23:2"/>Ulemeze ng'hatu maya ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:2">wone kwangugana kulya ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 23:3"/>Uleche konela maya vilyo vya heye vinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:3">kwa vila vyoweza kukuhada.<verse eid="PRO 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 23:4"/>Wone kuna luhala lwa kuhega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:4">uleche kitunya ng'hatu kupala lufufu lwinji.<verse eid="PRO 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 23:5"/>Lufufu lwangwajililaga baho du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:5">lwanguwaga kota lupatile mabawa baho du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:5">luguluche na kuluta kuli ulanga kota ikungule.<verse eid="PRO 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 23:6"/>Uleche kulya chilyo cha mbuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:6">ne konela maya vilyo vya heye vinojile,<verse eid="PRO 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 23:7"/>kwa vila mnhumbula mwa heye kanguwaza chila choulingulya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:7">Kokulonjela, “Ulye, unwe.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:7">Ila mnhumbula mwa heye hawele hamwe na hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 23:8"/>Hegwe kodeka vihande vyoudile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:8">malumbo ga hegwe geng'ha gowa ga hihi hela.<verse eid="PRO 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 23:9"/>Uleche kulonga mbuli za hegwe hali makutu ga mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:9">kwa vila kobeza luhala lwa ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 23:10"/>Uleche kusa ulajilo wa mbaka ja katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:10">ne kuhola migunda ja walekwa,<verse eid="PRO 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 23:11"/>kwa vila Nguluwi, Mgombozi, ndo yawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:11">naye koilewela hachi ya hewo kwa hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 23:12"/>Kwa nhumbula ya hegwe, uwinze malanguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:12">na kwa makutu uhulichize uwanzi.<verse eid="PRO 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 23:13"/>Umkanye mwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:13">wone umzape ng'hobwa, hobagama.<verse eid="PRO 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 23:14"/>Houmzapa, kokulohola kikala kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:14">kulawa kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="PRO 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 23:15"/>Mwana wa heni, wone nhumbula ya hegwe iwe na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:15">nhumbula ya heni yosangalala.<verse eid="PRO 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 23:16"/>Nhumbula ya heni yotowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:16">mlomo wa hegwe houlonga ulonzi wa hachi.<verse eid="PRO 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 23:17"/>Nhumbula ya hegwe ileche kuwonela maya wawele na gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:17">ila ilutilile kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PRO 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 23:18"/>Ndangukomya, hana kitumbila kunojile kwa chiwalo cha hegwe kuli mazuwa galinguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:18">na kitumbila ako hakukusigwa.<verse eid="PRO 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 23:19"/>Uhulichize mwana wa heni, uwe na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:19">wijese ng'hatu ndaze vyoulingikala.<verse eid="PRO 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 23:20"/>Uleche kuwa yumwe wa walingugala divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:20">ne walingulya lukami walingugana miwunde,<verse eid="PRO 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 23:21"/>kwa vila walingugala na walingulya lukami kuli kuduma wowa wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:21">yalingutumiya zuwa lya heye kusinzila kovala vibende.<verse eid="PRO 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 23:22"/>Umhulichize mhaza wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:22">uleche kumbeza mayako wone yalale.<verse eid="PRO 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 23:23"/>Ugule kukomya, uleche kukuguza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:23">uwe na luhala na malanguso na kuhulichiza.<verse eid="PRO 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 23:24"/>Mhaza wa mwana yatanganiche komema usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:24">yalingumponda mwana yawele na luhala, kosangalala kwa chiwalo cha heye.<verse eid="PRO 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 23:25"/>Uwadite mhaza na mayako wasangalale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:25">mamo yakupondile yasangalale.<verse eid="PRO 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 23:26"/>Mwana wa heni, unyhulichize goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:26">wibatilile madito ga kikala kwa heni.<verse eid="PRO 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 23:27"/>Mdala mng'hondwa ndo ikulubila liwele ng'wemang'wema lya kugwiliza wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:27">mdala ayo ndo idiwa.<verse eid="PRO 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 23:28"/>Heye kangivisa na kubeteza kota yalinguboka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:28">kangwambuzaga walume wenji wawe wohambe wakundigwe hali wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 23:29"/>Ndo wanhu wachi walingutowa iyowe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:29">Ndo wanhu wachi wawele na masinzo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:29">Ndo wanhu wachi wawele na kilewa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:29">Ndo wanhu wachi walingung'ung'uta?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:29">Ndo wanhu wachi wawele na vilonda ne chiwalo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:29">Ndo wanhu wachi wawele na meho madung'hu?<verse eid="PRO 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 23:30"/>Ndo wala wawele hambe woche hali divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:30">wala walingikalisa hafungo kujeza divai ihazanywe na ndugwa.<verse eid="PRO 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 23:31"/>Uleche kuyonela maya divai kwa udung'hu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:31">hanga yowa yopulika kuli chizombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:31">na kidulika mholemhole hounwa.<verse eid="PRO 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 23:32"/>Kuli kuduma yangulumaga kota izoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:32">yangulumiza kota izoka liwele na dunga.<verse eid="PRO 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 23:33"/>Meho ga hegwe govyona vinduzanduza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:33">nhumbula ya hegwe yokuhada.<verse eid="PRO 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 23:34"/>Kowa kota munhu yalingujeza kuwasa kuli meli mhela wa nhigu.<verse eid="PRO 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 23:35"/>Kolonga, “Nawanhowa, ila silumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:35">nawanhowa, ila nasivizelele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:35">Ndokwinuka nili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:35">Ubeteze tandi mhale chakunwa chinji.”<verse eid="PRO 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PRO 24"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 24:1"/>Uleche kuwonela fihi wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:1">na kugana kuwa hamwe na hewo,<verse eid="PRO 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 24:2"/>kwa vila majesa ga hewo geng'ha ndo kuwala kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:2">haduhu linojile lyoneche lilingulawa kuli milomo ja hewo.<verse eid="PRO 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 24:3"/>Ng'handa yanguzenjigwa kwa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:3">na kwimizwa nzinzili kwa kuvizela.<verse eid="PRO 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 24:4"/>Kwa uwanzi vihengo vyake vyangumemezwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:4">vinhu vya sendi nyinji na vya kunojeza.<verse eid="PRO 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 24:5"/>Munhu yawele na luhala kana ludali ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:5">naye yawele na uwanzi kangonjeza mong'ho.<verse eid="PRO 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 24:6"/>Kwa ulongozi unojile koweza kitowa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:6">na kusumya kwa winji wa wanhu walingukulonjela ganojile.<verse eid="PRO 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 24:7"/>Luhala lwa kuchanya ng'hatu kwa mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:7">kuli nhing'hano kahela cha kulonga.<verse eid="PRO 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 24:8"/>Yalingijesa kudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:8">kochemigwa mjuvi.<verse eid="PRO 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 24:9"/>Kiwika goya kudita chinhu kwa mpoka ndo gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:9">yalingubeza ndo izudizo kwa chila munhu.<verse eid="PRO 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 24:10"/>Wone uwe ng'hochele mhela wa magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:10">lelo hegwe ndo kwahela mong'ho lukami.<verse eid="PRO 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 24:11"/>Mlohole munhu yalinguholigwa kuluta kubagama hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:11">uleche kulemwela kumlohola yalingukopoligwa ne nongwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 24:12"/>Hamba uleche kulonga, “Hatuvizelele.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:12">Kwa vila Nguluwi yalingupima nhumbula za wanhu kangulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:12">heye yalinguwamila ukomu wa hemwe kanguvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:12">komha chila munhu kwa kiwhana na madito ga heye.<verse eid="PRO 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 24:13"/>Mwana wa heni, ulye hanombwa kwa vila ndo inoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:13">ilala lya hanombwa ndo linona kumlomo.<verse eid="PRO 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 24:14"/>Ndo vyoluwele luhala kuli nhumbula ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:14">wone ulupate mbuli za hegwe zolutilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:14">na kitumbila kwa hegwe hakukusigwa hihi hela.<verse eid="PRO 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 24:15"/>Uleche kubeteza kwa uviso kota mwihe kuhatowa haluga ha munhu yatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:15">uleche kujeza kuwifya ng'handa ya heye,<verse eid="PRO 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 24:16"/>kwa vila munhu yatanganiche kangugwa mala nyinji na kwinuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:16">ila mwihe hoyochikwang'hwala howeza kwinuka.<verse eid="PRO 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 24:17"/>Uleche kutowa luchenze kwa chiwalo cha kugwa kwa mng'honyo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:17">ne kusangalala mnhumbula mwa hegwe kwa kikwang'hwala kwa heye,<verse eid="PRO 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 24:18"/>kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi yalingugona ago honojezwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:18">hanji koleka kumgaza.<verse eid="PRO 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 24:19"/>Uleche kuzudila kwa chiwalo cha wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:19">ne kuwonela maya,<verse eid="PRO 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 24:20"/>kwa vila mwihe howa na ganojile hamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:20">chenje cha ukomu wa heye chozimigwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 24:21"/>Mwana wa heni, umdumbe Mkulu Nguluwi na kumhulichiza mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:21">uleche kilumba na walingubelenhuka,<verse eid="PRO 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 24:22"/>kwa vila kudumigwa kwa hewo kwanguwafikaga baho du.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:22">Haduhu yalinguvizela kutunya kowokwambuza.<verse eid="PRO 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhelo ziyage</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 24:23"/>Azo kahi ndo nhelo za wanhu wawele na luhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:23">Kuganilila wanhu kuli utaguso hakuwele kunojile.<verse eid="PRO 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 24:24"/>Yoneche yalingumlonjela yawele na nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:24">“Kwahela nongwa,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:24">kangupanjilwaga na wanhu na kuzudilwa na wanhu wa isi zinji.<verse eid="PRO 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 24:25"/>Ila walinguwagaza wehile wowa na usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:25">na utambichizo wokuya kwa hewo.<verse eid="PRO 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 24:26"/>Kwidichila kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:26">ndo kota kumkumbatila goloko.<verse eid="PRO 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 24:27"/>Ukole mijito ja hegwe kunze tandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:27">uwiche goya chila chinhu kumgunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:27">hamba uzenje ng'handa ya hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 24:28"/>Uleche kulavya ulolezi kwa munhu youlingikalasa habehi ne chiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:28">ne kulonga udesi kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 24:29"/>Uleche kulonga, “Ndomdita kota vyoyanditile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:29">Yangundapa nyhilule chibida.”<verse eid="PRO 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 24:30"/>Nang'hola habehi ha mgunda wa mgata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:30">mgunda wa mizabibu wa mpoka.<verse eid="PRO 24:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 24:31"/>Ulole, miwa najali jotile kuli chila honhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:31">misolo najigubika honhu hake heng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:31">na lukanzi lwake lwa maganga lubomoka.<verse eid="PRO 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 24:32"/>Nandola na kijesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:32">hamba nandilangusa.<verse eid="PRO 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 24:33"/>Uwase hado hela, usinzile hado.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:33">Uswinize moko ga hegwe wesele hado.<verse eid="PRO 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 24:34"/>Mhela awo uzunwa wokuvaba kota yalinguboka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:34">kupunguchilwa kokuwinza kota muhizi.<verse eid="PRO 24:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PRO 25"/>
  <para style="s">Nhelo zinji za Solomoni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 25:1"/>Azi nazo ndo nhelo zinji za mndewa Solomoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:1">zandichigwe na wanhu wa Hesekiya, mndewa wa Yuda.<verse eid="PRO 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 25:2"/>Nguluwi kangutogoligwa kwa kuvisa mbuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:2">ila mndewa kangutogoligwa kwa kupugajiza mbuli.<verse eid="PRO 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 25:3"/>Kota ulanga vyouwele kuchanya na misanga vyojiwele hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:3">ndo vyoziwele nhumbula za wandewa, hazilingupugajizika.<verse eid="PRO 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 25:4"/>Wuse wavu kuli sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:4">na mponzi kokugongomanyila chinhu chinojile.<verse eid="PRO 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 25:5"/>Uwose wehile hali mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:5">na undewa wa heye wowa nzinzili hali hachi.<verse eid="PRO 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 25:6"/>Uleche kiwika habehi na mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:6">uleche kidita kota kwa mkulu,<verse eid="PRO 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 25:7"/>kwa vila fola kulonjelwa, “Uye kuno kumwando,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:7">kusinda kuduliswa hali mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:7">Mbuli zouziwene kwa meho ga hegwe,<verse eid="PRO 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 25:8"/>uleche kudita himahima kuzigala kuli chitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:8">kwa vila kodita choni aho hamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:8">wone mlolezi yunji kogalema ago goulingulonga?<verse eid="PRO 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 25:9"/>Ulewele kilewa na myago yaliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:9">na chila yumwe wa hemwe yaleche kulavya uviso wa myage,<verse eid="PRO 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 25:10"/>leka wanhu waleche kuvizela kota hana uviso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:10">na kuliwifya itagwa lya hegwe mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PRO 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 25:11"/>Ulonzi ulingulonjigwa mhela unojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:11">ndo kota chinoligo cha zahabu chilingubatililwa na sendi.<verse eid="PRO 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 25:12"/>Makanyo ga yawele na luhala kwa munhu yalinguhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:12">ndo ganoga kusinda pete ya zahabu ama vinoligo vya zahabu inojile.<verse eid="PRO 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 25:13"/>Msenga yalingukundigwa kangumsangalaza mkulu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:13">kota mazi gazizime mhela wa ivuche.<verse eid="PRO 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 25:14"/>Kota vila ng'hungugu na mbeho ne nhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:14">ndo vyoyawele munhu yalingitutumula kulavya ndolendole, kuno yolemwela.<verse eid="PRO 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 25:15"/>Kwa kwimilila mndewa koweza kugalula majesa ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:15">umyango udeche wangubenaga mizeje.<verse eid="PRO 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 25:16"/>Houpata hanombwa ulye chasi cha kuhega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:16">ileche kukwambuza kudeka.<verse eid="PRO 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 25:17"/>Uleche kumjendela chila mhela munhu youlingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:17">uleche kumtunya mbaka yakuzudile.<verse eid="PRO 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 25:18"/>Munhu yalingulavya ulolezi wa udesi kumuwala myage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:18">ndo keha kota nyimbati na ipanga ama msale unoleche lukami.<verse eid="PRO 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 25:19"/>Kitumbila kuli munhu yohambe yakundigwe mhela wa magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:19">ndo kota izino lihile ama mgulu uvyuduche.<verse eid="PRO 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 25:20"/>Kumwimbila munhu yawele na masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:20">ndo kota kuvula nguwo mhela wa chipute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:20">ama kujela mwino kuli chilonda.<verse eid="PRO 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 25:21"/>Wone mng'honyo wa hegwe kana nzala, umhe chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:21">wone yawe na ng'halu, umhe mazi yanwe.<verse eid="PRO 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 25:22"/>Kwa vila kwa kudita ahyo komdita yone usungu mnhumbula kota makala ga chiluli mchanya muli mutwi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:22">naye Mkulu Nguluwi kokupa chonolo.<verse eid="PRO 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 25:23"/>Mbeho ya kasikazini yangigalaga nhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:23">na kuhehigwa kwangigalaga kuzudila.<verse eid="PRO 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 25:24"/>Fola kikala hafungo mchanya mwa chinduwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:24">kusinda kikala kaye hamwe na mche yalingugana kilewa.<verse eid="PRO 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 25:25"/>Kota vila mazi gazizime kwa yawele na ng'halu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:25">ndo vyoziwele mbuli zinojile kulawa isi ya kutali.<verse eid="PRO 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 25:26"/>Yatanganiche yalingukunda kuwinza mbuli za mwihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:26">ndo nzasa iwifigwe ama ideho litiguligwe.<verse eid="PRO 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 25:27"/>Hainojile kulya hanombwa nyinji ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:27">na kahi hailingutogoligwa kiwikawika kumwando lukami.<verse eid="PRO 25:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 25:28"/>Munhu yawele hambe yaweze kuilemeza ng'halazi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:28">ndo kota muji ulihela wamizi houtowigwa.<verse eid="PRO 25:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PRO 26"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 26:1"/>Hailingukundigwa kumtogola mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:1">kudita ahyo ndo kota seluji kuli mhela wa chipalangule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:1">ama nhonya kuli mhela wa mbena.<verse eid="PRO 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 26:2"/>Kota chideje chimwenga ama mbayuwayu wohambe waduliche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:2">na kahi upanjilo ulihela chiwalo, haumfika.<verse eid="PRO 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 26:3"/>Ng'hobwa za ngozi kwa falasi na chihande cha chuma kwa kulilongoza idogowi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:3">na ng'hobwa kwa mgongo wa mpoka.<verse eid="PRO 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 26:4"/>Uleche kumwidichila mpoka kwa upoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:4">leka uleche kiwhana na heye.<verse eid="PRO 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 26:5"/>Umwidichile mpoka kota vyoulinguganigwa upoka wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:5">yaleche kiwona kota ka yawele na luhala lukami.<verse eid="PRO 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 26:6"/>Kumlajiza mpoka kuhilika usenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:6">ndo kota kitema na kusa magulu ama kipalila magazo.<verse eid="PRO 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 26:7"/>Nhelo kumlomo mwa mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:7">ndo kota magulu ga chete galinguninila.<verse eid="PRO 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 26:8"/>Kumha lutogo mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:8">ndo kota kuwoha iganga kuli mhembeyo.<verse eid="PRO 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 26:9"/>Mpoka yalingujeza kutumiya nhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:9">ndo kota yagalile yalingujeza kusa liwa mmoko.<verse eid="PRO 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 26:10"/>Munhu yalingumhola mpoka ama yoneche yalingukola leka yamkolele mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:10">ndo kota yalingutowa msale yalingumlumiza chila munhu.<verse eid="PRO 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 26:11"/>Mpoka yalinguuhiluchila upoka wa heye chila mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:11">ndo kota libwa lilingulya cholidechile.<verse eid="PRO 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 26:12"/>Kwangumona munhu yalingidaya kota kana luhala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:12">Ndangukulonjela, fola mpoka kusinda ayo.<verse eid="PRO 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 26:13"/>Mgata kangulongaga, “Hana isimba mnzila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:13">Hana isimba kuli nzila ng'hulu!”<verse eid="PRO 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 26:14"/>Kota vila lwizi lulinguzunguluta kuli vibatililo vyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:14">ndo hihyo kwa mgata mchanya mwa chinhanda cha heye.<verse eid="PRO 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 26:15"/>Mgata kanguwikaga moko wa heye kuli luhelo lwa chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:15">ila kangutokaga lukami mbaka kangulemwela kwinula moko wa heye kuhilika kumlomo.<verse eid="PRO 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 26:16"/>Mgata kangiwonaga kota kana nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:16">kusinda wanhu saba walinguweza kwidichila kwa luhala.<verse eid="PRO 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 26:17"/>Yalingiyinjiza kuli kilewa hakuwele kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:17">ndo kota munhu yalingugabata makutu ga libwa lilingukola.<verse eid="PRO 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 26:18"/>Kota yawele na luweje yalingudawalila vyenje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:18">ama misale ja kubagama,<verse eid="PRO 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 26:19"/>ndo hihyo vyoyawele munhu yalingumhada yowalingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:19">hamba yalonje, “Nandali ndilonga hela.”<verse eid="PRO 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 26:20"/>Ne ngodi, chiluli changuzimaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:20">ne yalinguheha, kilewa kwangumalaga.<verse eid="PRO 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 26:21"/>Kota vila makala ama ngodi vyanguchidita chiluli kwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:21">ndo yalingugana kilewa vyoyalingonjezaga kilewa.<verse eid="PRO 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 26:22"/>Ulonzi wa munhu yalinguheha ndo kota chilyo chinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:22">chiwele changudulikaga du mbaka mmunda.<verse eid="PRO 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 26:23"/>Kota lanji ilingupulika iwele naibakalizwa kuli chisaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:23">ndo vyouwele ulonzi unojile uwele na kunuwila kwihile.<verse eid="PRO 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 26:24"/>Yalinguwazudila wanji kangivisaga kwa ulonzi wa mlomo wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:24">ila mnhumbula mwa heye kanguwaga na uhadi.<verse eid="PRO 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 26:25"/>Hanga ulonzi wa heye wowa unojile, uleche kumkunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:25">kwa vila mnhumbula mwa heye nakumema izudizo.<verse eid="PRO 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 26:26"/>Hanji kouvisa wihe wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:26">ila kunuwila kwa heye kwihile kozeleka kwa wanhu weng'ha.<verse eid="PRO 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 26:27"/>Yalingumbawila myage ikulubila, kangwinjilaga yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:27">yalingulikundujiza iganga kwa myage, lyomhiluchila yuye.<verse eid="PRO 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 26:28"/>Yalingulonga udesi kanguwazudilaga awo walingulumizwa na heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:28">naye yalingutogola kwa udesi kangigalaga kuwifya.<verse eid="PRO 26:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PRO 27"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 27:1"/>Uleche kitogola kwa chiwalo cha mitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:1">kwa vila huvizelele choni cholawila kuli zuwa limwe.<verse eid="PRO 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 27:2"/>Uleche wanhu wanji wakutogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:2">haiwele kwa mlomo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:2">munhu yunji yadite ahyo, haiwele gwegwe.<verse eid="PRO 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 27:3"/>Iganga na sangalaza ndo itunyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:3">ila kutunyigwa na mpoka ndo itunyo ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 27:4"/>Ng'halazi ndo kuwa na nhumbula yihile na kuzudila kung'hang'hale ndo kudumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:4">ila whaani yoweza kitwanza na fihi?<verse eid="PRO 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 27:5"/>Fola munhu yalingukukanya hazelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:5">kusinda yula yalinguvisa igano.<verse eid="PRO 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 27:6"/>Kung'hanuchila kwa goloko wa hegwe wa habehi kwangulajila kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:6">ila kulamswa na mng'honyo ndo uhadi.<verse eid="PRO 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 27:7"/>Yegute mbaka hanombwa kanguilema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:7">ila kwa yawele na nzala chila chiwele cha usungu ndo chinona.<verse eid="PRO 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 27:8"/>Munhu yajilile ndo kota chideje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:8">chajilile kutali na chimvulila chake.<verse eid="PRO 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 27:9"/>Mafuta na unhunyhililo kwa chiwalo cha lukuli vyanguisangalaza nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:9">na kunoga kwa goloko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:9">kwangulawa kuli ulonzi wa utanzi wa heye wa kukundigwa.<verse eid="PRO 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 27:10"/>Uleche kumsemwa goloko wa hegwe ne wa mhaza wa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:10">Wone uwe na magazo uleche kubilimila kwa mng'holozo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:10">fola munhu youlingikalasa habehi kusinda mwenyelukolo yawele kutali.<verse eid="PRO 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 27:11"/>Mwana wa heni, uwe na luhala leka uisangalaze nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:11">nani ndowa na lya kumwidichila yoneche yalingulonga vibi kuwala heni.<verse eid="PRO 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 27:12"/>Yawele na luhala kanguzonaga mbuli zihile na kivisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:12">ila mpoka kangiwikaga kumwando na kulumizwa.<verse eid="PRO 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 27:13"/>Wone munhu yelahe hali hegwe kota komuwichila lehani mjenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:13">uhole ivalo lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:13">leka yalipe sendi kwa vila nakamuwichila lehani ayo mjenzi.<verse eid="PRO 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 27:14"/>Yoneche yalingumtambichiza munhu yowalingikalasa habehi kwa iyowe lufuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:14">yozeleka kota kangumganila upanjilo.<verse eid="PRO 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 27:15"/>Mdala yalingugana kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:15">ndo kota midovu ja mazi zuwa lya nhonya johambe jimale,<verse eid="PRO 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 27:16"/>kumlemeza ndo kota kulemeza mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:16">ama kibata mafuta ga mzeituni kwa moko.<verse eid="PRO 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 27:17"/>Kota vila chuma vyochilingunola chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:17">ndo hihyo du munhu vyoyalingulanguswa na myage.<verse eid="PRO 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 27:18"/>Yalinguulolela mtini kangulyaga tini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:18">yalingumlolela mkulu wa heye kohulichizwa.<verse eid="PRO 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 27:19"/>Kota kumeho vyokulingiwona kuli mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:19">ndo munhu vyoyalingizela yuye mnhumbula.<verse eid="PRO 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 27:20"/>Kuli Kubagama na kuli Kuwifya, hambe vigute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:20">na meho ga wanhu hambe gegute.<verse eid="PRO 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 27:21"/>Zahabu ama sendi zangwelizwa kwa chiluli kuli itanulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:21">na munhu kangupimigwa kwa lutogo lwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 27:22"/>Umtwanje mpoka kuli ituli hamwe na ngano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:22">ila huweza kumbagula na upoka wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 27:23"/>Ujilolele goya ming'holo ja hegwe vyojiwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:23">ujilolele goya misenga ja hegwe,<verse eid="PRO 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 27:24"/>kwa vila lufufu haluweza kikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:24">ne itaji hambe likale lulelo lweng'ha.<verse eid="PRO 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 27:25"/>Mhela misolo jikalile najusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:25">na misolo minyale najizuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:25">najo misolo kulawa kuli chidunda najikungajizwa,<verse eid="PRO 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 27:26"/>ming'holo jokupa sufu kwa chiwalo cha mivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:26">mhene nazo koziguza na kugula migunda,<verse eid="PRO 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 27:27"/>jokupa matombo ga kuhega hegwe na ivyazi lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:27">na kwa chiwalo cha vitumagwa wa hegwe wadala.<verse eid="PRO 27:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PRO 28"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 28:1"/>Wehile wangubilimaga hanga hambe wawinjigwe na munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:1">ila watanganiche wangiwhana na isimba, kwa vila hambe wadumbe.<verse eid="PRO 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 28:2"/>Mhela isi hoiwa kuli kubelenhuka, yanguwa na vilongozi wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:2">ila yawele na kuvizela na uwanzi, kangibatililaga kikala goya kuli isi.<verse eid="PRO 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 28:3"/>Mzunwa yalinguwabunza wazunwa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:3">kangiwhana na nhonya ng'hulu ilinguwifya mizuchila.<verse eid="PRO 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 28:4"/>Wanhu walingubena malajizo wanguwatogolaga wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:4">ila walingibatilila malajizo wangitwanza na hewo.<verse eid="PRO 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 28:5"/>Wehile hawavizelele mana ya hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:5">ila walingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi wanguizela ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 28:6"/>Fola mzunwa yalingikala kwa kugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:6">kusinda yawele na lufufu yalingikala kwa kwajilila.<verse eid="PRO 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 28:7"/>Mwana yalingibatilila malajizo ndo yawele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:7">ila goloko wa wabuhu kangumbasaga soni mhaza wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 28:8"/>Yalingonjeza lufufu lwa heye kwa kugana liba ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:8">hoyobagama loluta kwa yunji yalinguwonela isungu wazunwa.<verse eid="PRO 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 28:9"/>Yalingulema kugahulichiza malajizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:9">mbaka kulanda kwa heye ndo izudizo kwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 28:10"/>Yalingumhada munhu yanojile kudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:10">kogwa kuli idiwa lya heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:10">ila walihela nongwa wohalila ganojile.<verse eid="PRO 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 28:11"/>Yawele na lufufu kangiwonaga kota ka yawele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:11">ila mzunwa yawele na luhala, kangukuzela kukomya kuwala ayo.<verse eid="PRO 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 28:12"/>Wone wanhu wanojile wapate ulongozi, wanhu wangusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:12">ila wone wehile walongoze, wanhu wangivisaga.<verse eid="PRO 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 28:13"/>Yalinguvisa nongwa za heye, mbuli za heye haziweza kuluta goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:13">ila yalingulonga gehile ga heye na kugaleka, kolechelwa.<verse eid="PRO 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 28:14"/>Kotambichizwa munhu yalingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:14">ila yawele na nhumbula igagadale, kogwila kuli magazo.<verse eid="PRO 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 28:15"/>Chilongozi mwihe yalinguwalongoza wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:15">ndo kota isimba lilingubuma ama idubu lilinguvaba.<verse eid="PRO 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 28:16"/>Chilongozi yalihela nyhala ndo yehile na kahela isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:16">ila yalinguzudila lufufu lwa uhadi kolongoza mhela winji.<verse eid="PRO 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 28:17"/>Munhu yalingutunyigwa na nongwa ya kukopola munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:17">kowa munhu wa kubilima mbaka kuli chilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:17">munhu yoneche yaleche kumtanza.<verse eid="PRO 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 28:18"/>Yalingikala kwa kutanganika koloholigwa na mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:18">ila yajilile kogwa baho du.<verse eid="PRO 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 28:19"/>Yalingulima mgunda wa heye kowa na chilyo chinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:19">ila yalinguwinza mbuli za kulota kowa mzunwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 28:20"/>Munhu yalingukundigwa kowa na utambichizo winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:20">ila yalingudita himahima kuwa na lufufu howeza kiwika kutali na magazo.<verse eid="PRO 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 28:21"/>Hainojile kulajila uganililo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:21">wanhu wanguditaga gehile mbaka kwa chihande cha ibumunda.<verse eid="PRO 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 28:22"/>Mbuhu kangubilimilaga lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:22">ne kuvizela kota uzunwa womuyila.<verse eid="PRO 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 28:23"/>Yalingumkanya myage hamba kanguwaga na ganojile ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:23">kusinda yula yalingumhembuliza kwa ulonzi unonile.<verse eid="PRO 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 28:24"/>Yalinguhiza lufufu lwa mhaza wa heye ama mayake, yolonga kota haiwele nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:24">ayo nakewhana hela na wahizi wanji.<verse eid="PRO 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 28:25"/>Mbuhu kangwambuzaga kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:25">ila yalingitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mbuli za heye zolutilila goya.<verse eid="PRO 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 28:26"/>Yalingitumbila nyhala za heye yuye ka mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:26">ila yalingikala kwa luhala, kowa na kikala goya.<verse eid="PRO 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 28:27"/>Yawele na isungu kwa wazunwa, hopunguchilwa chinhu choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:27">ila yalingulema kuwalolela, kopanjilwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 28:28"/>Wone wehile walongoze, wanhu wangivisaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:28">ila wone wadumigwe, watanganiche wangonjezekaga.<verse eid="PRO 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PRO 29"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 29:1"/>Wone yalingukanyigwa chila mhela, ila kangulutilila kuwa na nhumbula igagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:1">kodumigwa baho du, howeza kupona.<verse eid="PRO 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 29:2"/>Wone watanganiche walongoze, wanhu wangusangalalaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:2">ila wone wehile walongoze, wanhu wangung'ung'utaga.<verse eid="PRO 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 29:3"/>Yalingugana luhala kangumdita mhaza wa heye yasangalale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:3">ila yalinguwa hamwe na mng'hondwa kanguwifyaga lufufu lwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 29:4"/>Wone mndewa yatumiye hachi, kanguipaga isi kwima nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:4">ila wone yagane kubochela chinhu kwa uviso, isi yangudumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 29:5"/>Yalingumhembuliza munhu yowalingikalasa habehi kwa udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:5">kanguwika idiwa lya kigwiliza yuye.<verse eid="PRO 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 29:6"/>Mwihe kangugwilizwaga kwa gehile ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:6">ila yatanganiche kangwimbaga na kusangalala.<verse eid="PRO 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 29:7"/>Yatanganiche kanguzizela hachi za mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:7">ila mwihe hazizelele mbuli azo.<verse eid="PRO 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 29:8"/>Yalingubeza kangwambuzaga kilewa kuli muji weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:8">ila yawele na luhala kangukuditaga kilewa kusindamale.<verse eid="PRO 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 29:9"/>Wone yawele na luhala yetwanze na mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:9">mpoka kanguwaga na ng'halazi ng'hatu na kuseka ne kinyamalila.<verse eid="PRO 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 29:10"/>Walingugana kubohola danda, wangumzudilaga yalihela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:10">mbaka wanhu wanojile wanguzudilaga kikala kwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 29:11"/>Mpoka kangulajilaga ng'halazi ya heye ne uviso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:11">ila yawele na luhala kangilemezaga na kuidita isindamale.<verse eid="PRO 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 29:12"/>Wone mndewa yahulichize mbuli za udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:12">wang'hangala wa heye weng'ha wowa na wihe.<verse eid="PRO 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 29:13"/>Mzunwa na yalingubunza wangiwhana kwa chinhu chimwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:13">weng'ha weli nawapegwa meho na Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 29:14"/>Mndewa yalinguwamulila wazunwa kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:14">kowona ulongozi wa heye wangwima nzinzili mazuwa gose.<verse eid="PRO 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 29:15"/>Kuzapigwa na kukanyigwa, vyangigalaga luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:15">ila wone mwana kolechigwa yadite vyoyogana, kombasa soni mayake.<verse eid="PRO 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 29:16"/>Wone wehile walongoze, gehile gangonjezekaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:16">ila watanganiche wolola kugwa kwa hewo.<verse eid="PRO 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 29:17"/>Umkanye mwanago, naye hokudita uwe na lunhwinhwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:17">koisangalaza nhumbula ya hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 29:18"/>Wone hawe haduhu ulotezi wa chiuloli, wanhu wanguwaga walihela kuhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:18">ila nakatambichizwa munhu yula yalingubatilila malajizo.<verse eid="PRO 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 29:19"/>Mpogozi hambe yakanyigwe kwa ulonzi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:19">kwa vila ulonzi kanguuzela heye, hogana kuuhulichiza.<verse eid="PRO 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 29:20"/>Kwangumona munhu yalingulonga ne kijesa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:20">Fola mpoka kusinda heye.<verse eid="PRO 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 29:21"/>Yalingumhembuliza ng'hatu mpogozi wa heye kulawa uwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:21">hamba mpogozi ayo komtunya kuli kuduma.<verse eid="PRO 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 29:22"/>Yazudile kangwambuzaga kilewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:22">yalinguzudila himahima kangwambuzaga gehile menji.<verse eid="PRO 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 29:23"/>Kidaya kwa munhu kwangumdulisaga yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:23">ila yalingunyenyetela kopegwa lutogo.<verse eid="PRO 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 29:24"/>Yalinguwa hamwe na mhizi kangiwifya yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:24">kanguuhulikaga uhadi wa yula mhizi, ne kulonga chinhu.<verse eid="PRO 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 29:25"/>Kuwadumba wanhu ndo kiwichila idiwa gwegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:25">ila yalingitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi ka hali kikala goya.<verse eid="PRO 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 29:26"/>Wenji wanguganaga kiwika habehi na mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:26">ila munhu kangupegwa hachi ya heye kulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="PRO 29:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 29:27"/>Yalihela hachi ndo izudizo kwa yagoloche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:27">naye yagoloche ndo izudizo kwa mwihe.<verse eid="PRO 29:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PRO 30"/>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi wa Aguli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 30:1"/>Ulonzi wa Aguli, mwana wa Yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:1">ulonzi uwele munhu ayu nakamlonjela Itieli, ena, Itieli na Ukali.<verse eid="PRO 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 30:2"/>Heni nda mpoka lukami kusinda wanhu weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:2">ndahela nyhala ya chiwunhu.<verse eid="PRO 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 30:3"/>Hambe ndilanguse luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:3">sivizelele chinhu choneche chilingumuwala Nguluwi Yelile.<verse eid="PRO 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 30:4"/>Whaani yakwinile kuchanya kilanga hamba nakadulika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Whaani yebatile mbeho mmoko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Whaani yawohile mazi kuli chibende?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Whaani yajiwichile mbaka jeng'ha ja isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Kanguchemigwa whaani? Ndo lyachi itagwa lya mwanage?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Ndonjele wone kwanguvizela.<verse eid="PRO 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 30:5"/>Ulonzi weng'ha wa Nguluwi ndo wenela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:5">heye ndo ngawo ya hewo weng'ha walingumbilimila.<verse eid="PRO 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 30:6"/>Uleche konjeza ulonzi kuli ulonzi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:6">leka yaleche kukung'hanuchila, nagwe kokoneka kwa mdesi.<verse eid="PRO 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 30:7"/>Gwa Nguluwi, ndangukulanda mbuli azi mbili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:7">uleche kundemela nding'hali bagama.<verse eid="PRO 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 30:8"/>Umbusile udesi na uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:8">uleche kumha heni uzunwa ne lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:8">umhe heni chilyo cha chila zuwa,<verse eid="PRO 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 30:9"/>wone ndahagutile, ndahakubelile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:9">na kulonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi ndo whaani?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:9">Ama ndahawele mzunwa, hamba ndahahizile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:9">na kukubeza, gwa Nguluwi wa heni.<verse eid="PRO 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 30:10"/>Uleche kumlonjeleza mpogozi kwa mkulu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:10">leka yaleche kukupanjila, woneche kuna nongwa.<verse eid="PRO 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 30:11"/>Hana wanhu wawele wanguwapanjilaga wahaza wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:11">na kuleka kuwatambichiza wamamo wa hewo.<verse eid="PRO 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 30:12"/>Hana wanhu wawele wangiwonaga kota wanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:12">kuno wang'hali kwelizwa wavu wa hewo.<verse eid="PRO 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 30:13"/>Wabaho wanji walingidaya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:13">wangubezaga chila chinhu chowalinguchona.<verse eid="PRO 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 30:14"/>Hana wanhu wawele ulonzi wa hewo ndo kota ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:14">na mizino ja hewo ndo kota vimaje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:14">Nawewika goya kuwadakula wazunwa wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:14">na walihela chinhu wawele hali wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 30:15"/>Iluba lina wahinza weli walingulonga, “Umhe heni, umhe heni.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:15">Hana vinhu vidatu viwele hambe vigute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:15">ena, chinhu cha kane chohambe chilonje, “Ihega.”<verse eid="PRO 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 30:16"/>Kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:16">munda wa mdala wohambe uponde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:16">misanga johambe jigute mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:16">na chiluli chohambe chilonje, “Ihega.”<verse eid="PRO 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 30:17"/>Wone munhu yambeze mhaza wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:17">na kubeza kuhulichiza kwa mayake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:17">mibondwa ja kibindi jodobola meho ga mtufi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:17">na kuligwa na ikungule.<verse eid="PRO 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 30:18"/>Hana mbuli zidatu za kububuwaza kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:18">ena, mbuli ya kane yohambe ndiizelele.<verse eid="PRO 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 30:19"/>Nzila ya ikungule kuli ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:19">nzila ya izoka kuli italawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:19">nzila ya meli kuli bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:19">na chilingumkwega mlume kwa mdala.<verse eid="PRO 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 30:20"/>Madito ga mdala mng'hondwa ndo aga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:20">Kangulyaga na kibagusa mlomo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kangulyaga na kibagusa mlomo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ulonzi awu una mana ya mdala kudita ung'hondwa hamba kihovuga.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:20">na kulonga, “Siditile nongwa yoneche.”<verse eid="PRO 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 30:21"/>Hana mbuli zidatu ziwele zilinguidita isi ikakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:21">ena, mbuli ya kane iwele isi haiweza kwimilila.<verse eid="PRO 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 30:22"/>Mpogozi yalinguwa mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:22">mpoka yalingiguta chilyo,<verse eid="PRO 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 30:23"/>mdala yohambe yaganigwe, hoyohesigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:23">na mpogozi mdala yalinguhola honhu ha mdala wa mkulu wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 30:24"/>Hana vilumbigwe vine vidodo ng'hatu muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:24">ila vina nyhala ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 30:25"/>Misisina ndo minhu jilihela mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:25">ila jangiwichila chilyo mhela wa chipalangule,<verse eid="PRO 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 30:26"/>mhimbi, migongolo jilihela ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:26">ila jangigongomanyila honhu ha kikala hali mitalawe,<verse eid="PRO 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 30:27"/>nzije zahela mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:27">ila zeng'ha zangulutaga hamwe kwa vilundo,<verse eid="PRO 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 30:28"/>limdusu, koweza kulibata mmoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:28">ila lyangwinjilaga kuli ng'handa ya mndewa.<verse eid="PRO 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 30:29"/>Hana vilumbigwe vidatu vilingujenda kwa kunojeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:29">ena, cha kane chilingujenda kwa kunojeza.<verse eid="PRO 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 30:30"/>Isimba ndo igongolo liwele na mong'ho kusinda jeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:30">halilingudumba igongolo lyoneche,<verse eid="PRO 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 30:31"/>izogolo lilinguluta kwa kidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:31">na kahi ipongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:31">na mndewa yalihela wang'honyo.<verse eid="PRO 30:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 30:32"/>Wone nakudita upoka na kitogola gwegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:32">ama wone nawali uchijesa kudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:32">wamile mlomo wa hegwe.<verse eid="PRO 30:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 30:33"/>Kwa vila wone utijetije matombo, kopata siagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:33">wone umtowe munhu kuli mhenyelo, kolawa danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:33">na kahi konjeza ng'halazi, kwangigalaga kilewa.<verse eid="PRO 30:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PRO 31"/>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi kwa mndewa Lemweli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 31:1"/>Ulonzi wa mndewa Lemweli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:1">Ulonzi woyalangusigwe na mayake.<verse eid="PRO 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 31:2"/>Ndikulonjele choni mwana wa heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:2">Ndikulonjele choni mwana wa heni hegwe yondikupondile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:2">Ndikulonjele choni hegwe yondikulandile kwa Nguluwi?<verse eid="PRO 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 31:3"/>Uleche kitunya kwa chiwalo cha wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:3">uleche kuwapa lufufu lwa hegwe awo walinguwadumya wandewa.<verse eid="PRO 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 31:4"/>Hailingutanza chinhu, gwa Lemweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:4">haiwele goya wandewa kunwa divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:4">ne wakulu konela maya ujimbi.<verse eid="PRO 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 31:5"/>Wone wanwe wosemwa malajizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:5">na kwajiliza hachi za wazunwa.<verse eid="PRO 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 31:6"/>Umhe ujimbi munhu yawele habehi kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:6">uwape divai wala wawele na masinzo ng'hatu,<verse eid="PRO 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 31:7"/>wanwe na kusemwa uzunwa wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:7">leka waleche kukumbuchila kahi magazo ga hewo.<verse eid="PRO 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 31:8"/>Ila hegwe, yangukulapa ulonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:8">kwa chiwalo cha weng'ha wohambe waweze kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:8">na kulewela hachi za weng'ha walihela ludali.<verse eid="PRO 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 31:9"/>Ulonje kwa chiwalo cha hewo na kwamula kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:9">wamile hachi za wazunwa na walihela chinhu.<verse eid="PRO 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mdala yalingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 31:10"/>Mdala yawele na nhumbula inojile kangoneka kohi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:10">Ayo ndo yanojile ng'hatu kusinda johali.<verse eid="PRO 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 31:11"/>Mlume wa heye kangumkundaga ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:11">kwa heye kopata chinhu cha mzidi ng'hatu.<verse eid="PRO 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 31:12"/>Halingumditila mbuli zihile mlume wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:12">ila kangumditilaga ganojile kuli kikala kwa heye kweng'ha.<verse eid="PRO 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 31:13"/>Kangupalaga sufu na kitani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:13">na kukola mijito kwa moko gake kwa kikangaza.<verse eid="PRO 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 31:14"/>Heye ndo kota meli za kugula na kuguza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:14">kangigalaga chilyo cha heye kulawa kutali.<verse eid="PRO 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 31:15"/>Kangwinukaga lufuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:15">kanguliwichilaga goya ivyazi lya heye chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:15">na kuwagawila mijito vitumagwa wa heye wadala.<verse eid="PRO 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 31:16"/>Kangijesaga kugula mgunda, hamba kanguugulaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:16">kwa kiwhana na choyalingupata kangunyalaga mizabibu kuli mgunda awo.<verse eid="PRO 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 31:17"/>Kanguwaga goya kukola mijito kwa mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:17">na moko ga heye gana mong'ho kuli mijito ja heye.<verse eid="PRO 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 31:18"/>Kanguvizela kota mijito ja heye jina chinhu cha mzidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:18">kangukolaga mijito mbaka nechilo kwa lumuli lwa chenje cha heye.<verse eid="PRO 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 31:19"/>Kangubotaga uzi kwa moko ga heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:19">kwa vidole vya heye kangutawaga nguwo za heye.<verse eid="PRO 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 31:20"/>Kangugololaga moko wa heye kuwapa wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:20">na kuwatanza walihela chinhu.<verse eid="PRO 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 31:21"/>Kahela lunhwinhwi kuwala wanhu wa heye hokuwa na chipute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:21">kwa vila chila yumwe kanazo nguwo za kuhega.<verse eid="PRO 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 31:22"/>Kangigongomanyilaga micheka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:22">mivalo ja heye ndo ja kitani inojile ja lanji ya zambalau.<verse eid="PRO 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 31:23"/>Mlume wa heye ka munhu yalingutogoligwa kuli lwizi lwa muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:23">hoyochikalisa hali wasekulu wa isi.<verse eid="PRO 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 31:24"/>Mdala ayo kanguwaga yogongomanya nguwo na kuguza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:24">kanguwaguzilaga misali walingugula na kuguza.<verse eid="PRO 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 31:25"/>Mong'ho na kuhulichiza ndo lutogo lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:25">kangusekaga hoyochijesa kuwala mhela ulinguya.<verse eid="PRO 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 31:26"/>Kangulongaga kwa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:26">na malanguso ga igano lya kwimilila kwa umyango wa heye.<verse eid="PRO 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 31:27"/>Kangupugajizaga geng'ha galingukoleka kaye kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:27">halingikalisa hihi hela ne hado.<verse eid="PRO 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 31:28"/>Wana wa heye wangulilimkaga na kulonga malumbo kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:28">mlume wa heye kangwimbaga lutogo lwa heye.<verse eid="PRO 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 31:29"/>Kangulongaga, “Wadala wenji nawadita mbuli zinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:29">ila hegwe nakuwasumya weng'ha.”<verse eid="PRO 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 31:30"/>Ulonzi ulingunojeza wangudetaga na kunoga kwa kumeho kwangukolaga himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:30">ila mdala yalingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi kotogoligwa.<verse eid="PRO 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 31:31"/>Chituguti cha heye changuganigwa kulipigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:31">mijito ja heye janguganigwa kutogoligwa honeche.<verse eid="PRO 31:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 31"/>
</usx>
